{"id": "6251", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6251", "title": "Jean-Marie Gu\u00e9henno", "text": "Jean-Marie Gu\u00e9henno (yavutse ku wa 30 Ukwakira 1949 i Paris) ni umudipolomate w\u2019Umufaransa. Kuva mu 2000 kugeza mu 2008, yabaye Umunyamabanga Mukuru Wungirije w\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye (Loni) ushinzwe ibikorwa byo kubungabunga amahoro (\"Peacekeeping Operations\").\nUbuzima n\u2019amashuri.\nNi umuhungu w\u2019umwanditsi Jean Gu\u00e9henno na Annie Gu\u00e9henno, wari mu barwanyi ba \"R\u00e9sistance\" mu gihe cy\u2019Intambara ya Kabiri y\u2019Isi. Yize muri \u00c9cole normale sup\u00e9rieure no muri \u00c9cole nationale d\u2019administration (ENA), nyuma akora muri \"Cour des comptes\". Yayoboye ishami rishinzwe igenamigambi rya politiki mu Minisiteri y\u2019Ububanyi n\u2019Amahanga y\u2019Ubufaransa (1989\u20131993), hanyuma ayobora Institut des hautes \u00e9tudes de d\u00e9fense nationale (IHEDN) kuva mu 1998 kugeza mu 2000.\nUmwuga muri Loni.\nYashyizweho na Kofi Annan, ayobora ibikorwa bya Loni byo kubungabunga amahoro kuva ku wa 1 Ukwakira 2000. Muri icyo gihe ibyo bikorwa byagutse kurusha ikindi gihe cyose, bigera ku bakozi bagera ku 130 000 mu butumwa 18. Yavuye kuri uwo mwanya mu 2008.\nKuva muri Werurwe kugeza muri Nyakanga 2012, yabaye Intumwa Yihariye Wungirije ya Loni n\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Ibihugu by\u2019Abarabu muri Siriya.\nIndi mirimo.\nYahawe impeta ya \"L\u00e9gion d\u2019honneur\" (Officier) n\u2019iya \"Bundesverdienstkreuz\" y\u2019Ubudage (Commandeur)."}
