{"id": "6337", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6337", "title": "Ikirunga cya Bisoke", "text": "Ikirunga cya Bisoke kiri muri pariki nasiyonali y'u Rwanda na pariki natiyonali ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nUmusozi wa Bisoke ni ikirunga gikora giherereye mu misozi ya Virunga mu gice cya Albertine Rift, ishami ry\u2019iburengerazuba rya East African Rift. Uherereye ku mupaka w\u2019u Rwanda na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, ariko impinga yawo iri mu Rwanda."}
