{"id": "6349", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6349", "title": "Umupira w\u2019agatebo", "text": "Umupira w\u2019agatebo cyangwa Basiketi (izina mu cyongereza \"basketball\") ni umukino ukuzwe cyane, Ukinwa n'amakipe abiri agizwe n'abakinnyi batanu batanu, bagamie gutsinda amanota batera umupira mu gatebo(basket) kari ku butumburuke bwa metero 3.05, Uyu mukino usaba kwihuta, ubuhanga mu guhererekanya, no gutsinda amanota mu gatebo. \nKomiseri wa shampiyona w'umupira w'agatebo (Basktetball) muri Leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika(NBA), Adam Silver, avugako irushanwa ry'umupira w'agatebo (Basketball) rizajya rihuza amakipe y'i Burayi ko rigomba kwigarurira abafana nkuko umupira w'amaguru umaze kwigarurira abawufana.\nMu mwaka ushize nibwo NBA Yatangaje ko mu myaka ibiri iri imbere izafatanya n'ishyirahamwe ry'Umupira wagatebo(Basketball) ku Isi(FIBA), hagatangizwa irushanwa rishya rizajya rihuza amakipe akomeye i Burayi.\nAndi makuru.\nKimwe no mu bihugu byinshi bya Afurika, no mu Rwanda umupira wagatebo(Basketball) ufatwa nk'umukino wo mu miyi, by'umwihariko ntuzwi nk'umukino w'abagore bo mu cyaro. usa amatsinda y'abagore mu bice by'icyaro mu burasirazuba bw'u Rwanda barimo guhindura iyi mitekerereze."}
