{"id": "6622", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6622", "title": "Umuzinzigwa", "text": "Kwivuga bya kinyarwanda Igitaramo kigeze hagati, umwana witwa \u2018Nyirurugo\u2019 na we yahawe umwanya ngo agaragaze ko no mu bakiri bato, umuco gakondo uhabwa umwanya. Nyirurugo yarataratse maze arivuga biratinda, ibintu byashimishije imbaga yari iteraniye muri Petit Stade i Remera."}
