{"id": "6629", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6629", "title": "Umuhumuro", "text": "Umusebeya (izina ry\u2019ubumenyi mu kilatini \"*Albizia gummifera*\") ni ubwoko bw\u2019igiti.\n\u2705inkomoko\nMuri Afurika yegereye umurongo wa koma. \n\u2705Aho iterwa mu \nRwanda\nHose mu gihugu uretse muBugarama, mu misozi miremire ya cyangugu,\n\u2705Umubare w\u2019imbuto mu kiro 1\n\u2705Ibyo zikenera\nubutaka buhitisha \namazi neza, \nbuhehereye bwo \nhejuru, mu mabanga \ny\u2019imisozi no mu \nmibande.;\n-Ubutumburuke buri \nhagati ya m 1500 \nkugeza kuri m 2200 \n\u2705Uko zitegurwa, uko ziterwa n\u2019uko zikorerwa\nKwinaza umurama ukimara gusarurwa ni ngombwa kugirango uzamere. \nImbuto zayo \nzirimeza hasi mu murima.\n\u2705Akamaro\nAmasanduku, imihini, inkwi \nn\u2019amakara. kuribwa n\u2019amatungo, isaso, igicucu, indabo zitanga ubuki.,gifata \nubutaka, igiti cy\u2019umutako\n\u2705Indwara \nn\u2019ibyonnyi.\nUmusebeya ugira igiti kidakomera \ncyane iyo gihuye n\u2019itaka cyangwa amazi kandi cyangizwa n\u2019udusimba \nn\u2019uduhumyo. "}
