{"id": "6821", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6821", "title": "Ubuki", "text": "Ubuki ni kimwe mu biribwa bitera umubiri imbaraga. Ubuki bukomoka ku mutobe inzuki zivana mu ndabyo z\u2019ibiti cyangwa ibimera nk\u2019ibiryo zifashishije umushongi (nectors) zikabubika mu binyangu. Ubuki bufite ibara rijya gusa nk\u2019 ibihogo. Mu buryo bw\u2019ubutabire bukozwe n\u2019ubwoko bu biri bw\u2019ibitera imbaraga bita fructose na glucose. Mubusanzwe ubuki bugizwe n\u2019isukari n\u2019amazi n\u2019inzindi ntungamubiri zitandukanye nk\u2019imyunyu ngugu. \nUbuki n\u2019isukari n\u2019ubwoko bw\u2019ibitera imbaraga bikaba bimwe mu bintu biryoherera cyane (sweeteners) kandi bikunze gukoreshwa cyane ku isi mu nganda, mu gukora ibiribwa n\u2019ibinyobwa bitandukanye.\nN'ubwo bamwe na bamwe bakunda kwitiranya isukari n\u2019ubuki kuko bijya byenda gukora kimwe, hari itandukaniro rinini hagati ya byo. Hari abakoresha ubuki mu mwanya w\u2019isukari nk\u2019uburyo bwo kwirinda umubyibuho ukabije cyangwa kugabanya ibiro, naho bamwe mu barwaye diyabete bakabwifashisha mu mwanya w\u2019isukari. Urubuga Kigali Today rwagaragajeko ubuki bugira ibyiza byinshi ariko iyo budakoreshejwe mu rugero rwiza bwateza ingaruka mbi k\u2019ubukoresha. Kuko ubuki ari umwimere benshi bakunda kuvuga ko buba bwiza kurusha isukari iyo bukoreshejwe neza. "}
