{"id": "6838", "revid": "15375", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6838", "title": "Urwandiko rw\u2019Abafilipi", "text": "Urwandiko rw\u2019Abafilipi ni igitabo cyo mu Isezerano Rishya muri Bibiliya. Uru rwandiko rwanditswe ni ntumwa Pawulo yandikiwe abakristo bo mu mujyi wa filipi muri makedoniya. Uru rwandiko rwandikiwe pawulo aho yari afungiye. Abantu benshi bemeranya ko ari i Roma. Imwe mu mpamvu yayanditse yagira ngo abashimire inkunga bamwoherereje. Umurongo wamenyekanye cyane akaba ari Abafilipi 4:13 handitse ngo nshobozwa byose na Krisito umpa imbaraga."}
