{"id": "6912", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6912", "title": "Uburundi", "text": "Uburundi, ku mugaragaro Repubulika y'u Burundi, ni igihugu kidakora ku inyanja giherereye muri Afurika yo hagati n'iy'Iburasirazuba, mu karere k'Ibiyaga Bigari. Gihana imbibi n'u Rwanda mu majyaruguru, Tanzaniya mu burasirazuba no mu majyepfo, na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo mu burengerazuba, aho Ikiyaga cya Tanganyika kigitandukanya na yo. Umurwa mukuru wa politiki ni Gitega, naho Bujumbura ni wo murwa mukuru w'ubukungu n'umujyi munini. Ni kimwe mu bihugu bito kandi bituwe cyane muri Afurika.\nIzina.\nIzina \"Uburundi\" rikomoka ku bwami bwa kera bw'Abarundi. Abaturage bacyo bitwa Abarundi (umuntu umwe: \"Umurundi\"), naho ururimi rwabo ni ikirundi, rwegeranye cyane n'ikinyarwanda.\nImiterere y'igihugu.\nUburundi bufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 27 834, bukaba bugizwe ahanini n'imisozi n'imirambi miremire. Mu burengerazuba hari ikibaya cya Rusizi n'inkengero z'Ikiyaga cya Tanganyika, hejuru yacyo hakaba umurongo w'imisozi itandukanya ibibaya by'inzuzi Kongo na Nili. Umusozi muremure ni Heha (m 2 684). Mu burasirazuba, uruzi Ruvubu rwisuka mu Kagera; isoko iri kure cyane mu majyepfo y'uruzi Nili ivugwa ko iri mu Burundi, mu ntara ya kera ya Bururi.\nIkirere ni icy'akarere gashyuha ariko koroherejwe n'ubutumburuke; igihugu kigira ibihe bibiri by'imvura n'ibihe by'izuba. Ishyamba rya Kibira, mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba, rifatanye n'ishyamba rya Nyungwe ryo mu Rwanda.\nAmateka.\nUbwami bw'u Burundi.\nUbwami bw'u Burundi bwavutse ahagana mu kinyejana cya 17, buyoborwa n'umwami (\"mwami\") wafatwaga nk'umubyeyi w'igihugu, afashijwe n'abatware b'imiryango y'ibikomangoma (\"abaganwa\"). Ingoma yari ikimenyetso cy'ubwami.\nUbukoloni.\nMu mpera z'ikinyejana cya 19, Uburundi bwinjijwe mu Ntara y'Abadage y'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. Nyuma y'Intambara ya Mbere y'Isi Yose, bwahawe Ububiligi ku buryo bw'ubutegetsi bwa Ishyirahamwe ry'Amahanga, bufatanywa n'u Rwanda mu cyitwaga Ruanda-Urundi. Nyuma ya 1946, bwabaye igihugu kirindwa n'Umuryango w'Abibumbye bukomeza kuyoborwa n'Ababiligi. Igikomangoma Louis Rwagasore, wari uyoboye ishyaka UPRONA ryatsinze amatora yo mu 1961, yishwe mu Ukwakira 1961.\nKuva ku bwigenge.\nUburundi bwabonye ubwigenge ku wa 1 Nyakanga 1962 ari ubwami buyobowe n'umwami Mwambutsa IV. Mu 1966, Kapiteni Michel Micombero yakuyeho ubwami ashyiraho repubulika. Amateka y'igihugu nyuma y'ubwigenge yaranzwe n'amakimbirane hagati y'Abahutu n'Abatutsi, harimo ubwicanyi bwo mu 1972 n'ihirikwa ry'ubutegetsi ryinshi, nk'iryazanye Pierre Buyoya mu 1987.\nMu 1993, Melchior Ndadaye yabaye Perezida wa mbere w'Umuhutu watowe mu matora ya demokarasi, ariko yicwa nyuma y'amezi make, bituma igihugu cyinjira mu ntambara y'abenegihugu yahitanye abantu babarirwa mu 300 000. Uwamusimbuye, Cyprien Ntaryamira, yaguye mu ndege yarashwe i Kigali ku wa 6 Mata 1994. Amasezerano y'amahoro ya Arusha (2000) yashyizeho inzira yo kugabana ubutegetsi.\nMu 2005, Pierre Nkurunziza yatorewe kuba Perezida. Icyemezo cye cyo kwiyamamariza manda ya gatatu mu 2015 cyateje imyigaragambyo, igerageza ry'ihirikwa ry'ubutegetsi n'ihunga ry'Abarundi benshi bajya mu bihugu by'abaturanyi, harimo u Rwanda. \u00c9variste Ndayishimiye yamusimbuye nyuma y'amatora yo mu 2020. Mu 2019, Gitega yagizwe umurwa mukuru wa politiki.\nPolitiki n'ubutegetsi.\nUburundi ni repubulika iyobowe na Perezida, ari na we mukuru wa guverinoma, afashijwe na Visi-Perezida na Minisitiri w'Intebe. Inteko Ishinga Amategeko igizwe n'imitwe ibiri: Inteko Nshingamategeko na Sena. Ishyaka CNDD-FDD ni ryo riri ku butegetsi kuva mu 2005.\nKuva mu 2025, igihugu kigabanyijemo intara 5 \u2014 Buhumuza, Bujumbura, Burunga, Butanyerera na Gitega \u2014 zigabanyijemo amakomine 42, bisimbura intara 18 zabanzaga.\nAbaturage n'indimi.\nUburundi bufite abaturage bagera kuri miliyoni 14 (igereranya rya 2024), benshi muri bo baba mu cyaro. Abarundi bagizwe n'Abahutu (\u2248 85 %), Abatutsi (\u2248 14 %) n'Abatwa (\u2248 1 %).\nIkirundi ni ururimi rw'igihugu ruvugwa n'abaturage hafi ya bose; Igifaransa n'Icyongereza na zo ni indimi zemewe. Igiswahili kivugwa cyane cyane i Bujumbura no mu bucuruzi.\nAmadini.\nAbenshi mu Barundi ni Abakirisitu: Abagatolika ni bo benshi, bagakurikirwa n'Abaporotesitanti. Hari kandi abayoboke ba Islamu bake n'abakurikiza imyemerere gakondo.\nUmuco.\nIngoma z'i Burundi zizwi ku isi yose. Mu 2014, imbyino gakondo y'ingoma y'ubwami yashyizwe na UNESCO ku rutonde rw'umurage ndangamuco udafatika w'abantu bose.\nUbukungu.\nUbukungu bw'u Burundi bushingiye cyane ku buhinzi, bukoresha igice kinini cy'abakozi. Ibihingwa by'ingenzi byoherezwa mu mahanga ni ikawa n'icyayi; abaturage bahinga kandi igitoki, imyumbati, ibijumba, ibigori n'ibishyimbo. Uburundi ni kimwe mu bihugu bikennye cyane ku isi, bukaba bufite ibibazo byo kubura amadovize, ubucucike bw'abaturage n'imirire mibi.\nImibanire n'amahanga.\nUburundi ni umunyamuryango w'Umuryango w'Abibumbye, w'Ubumwe bw'Afurika, n'Umuryango w'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba (EAC) kuva mu 2007. Ni kandi umunyamuryango w'Umuryango Mpuzamahanga w'Ibihugu Bikoresha Igifaransa (OIF)."}
