{"id": "6938", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6938", "title": "Nairobi", "text": "Nairobi ni umurwa mukuru w'i Kenya. Usibye umujyi wacyo, umujyi ufite parike yigihugu ya Nairobi, ikibuga kinini cyimikino kizwiho korora imvubu z'umukara zibangamiwe kandi zibamo giraffi, zebra n'intare. Kuruhande rwayo ni impfubyi yubahwa cyane yinzovu ikorwa na David Sheldrick Wildlife Trust. Nairobi nayo ikoreshwa kenshi nko gusimbuka ingendo za safari ahandi muri Kenya."}
