{"id": "7030", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=7030", "title": "Umurenge wa Rubona", "text": "Umurenge wa Rubona ni umwe mu mirenge 14 igize Akarere ka Rwamagana, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba, mu Rwanda. Ugizwe n'utugari 6 n'imidugudu 38.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Rubona wari utuwe n'abaturage 29 916. Muri uyu murenge hari Umudugudu w'Urubyiruko wa Agahozo-Shalom.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nImiterere.\nUmurenge wa Rubona uri mu majyepfo y'Akarere ka Rwamagana. Ugera ku Ikiyaga cya Mugesera, gitandukanya Akarere ka Rwamagana n'Akarere ka Ngoma. Umurenge ufite ubuso bwa 55,53 km\u00b2.\nUtugari.\nUmurenge wa Rubona ugizwe n'utugari 6 n'imidugudu 38:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Rubona wari utuwe n'abaturage 24 136. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 29 916.\nUburezi.\nUmudugudu w'Urubyiruko wa Agahozo-Shalom (Agahozo-Shalom Youth Village) uri mu Murenge wa Rubona. Ni ikigo cyakira urubyiruko. Gifite ishuri ryisumbuye.\nAndi mashuri yisumbuye ari muri uyu murenge ni:\nIshuri ry\u2019Imyuga rya Rubona (Tubona Vocational Training Centre) naryo riri muri uyu murenge.\nUbuvuzi n'ibikorwaremezo.\nUmurenge ufite Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Rubona.\nKu butaka bwa Agahozo-Shalom hari uruganda rwa mbere mu Rwanda rutanga amashanyarazi akomoka ku mirasire y'izuba ku muyoboro w'igihugu. Muri uyu murenge kandi hari isoko rya kijyambere."}
