{"id": "7449", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=7449", "title": "Akarere ka Gakenke", "text": "Akarere ka Gakenke ni kamwe mu turere dutanu tugize Intara y'Amajyaruguru mu Rwanda. Gafite ubuso bwa 704,06 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 365 292. Kagizwe n'imirenge 19.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'imbibi.\nMu majyaruguru, Akarere ka Gakenke gahana imbibi n'Akarere ka Musanze. Mu burengerazuba hari uturere twa Nyabihu na Ngororero. Mu majyepfo ashyira uburengerazuba hari Akarere ka Muhanga. Mu majyepfo hari Akarere ka Kamonyi. Mu burasirazuba hari Akarere ka Rulindo. Mu majyaruguru ashyira uburasirazuba hari Akarere ka Burera.\nIbiro by'akarere biri mu Murenge wa Gakenke, mu Kagari ka Rusagara, mu Mudugudu wa Kabaya. Akarere kagizwe n'imirenge 19, utugari 97 n'imidugudu 617. Gafite ubuso bwa 704,06 km\u00b2.\nMuri 2022, akarere kari gatuwe n'abaturage 365 292. Abagore ni 192 692, abagabo ni 172 600. Ubucucike ni abaturage 520 kuri km\u00b2. Abaturage 96 % batuye mu cyaro.\nImirenge.\nAkarere ka Gakenke kagizwe n'imirenge 19:"}
