{"id": "7502", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=7502", "title": "Umurenge wa Sovu", "text": "Umurenge wa Sovu ni umwe mu mirenge 13 igize Akarere ka Ngororero, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba, mu Rwanda. Ugizwe n'utugari 6.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Sovu wari utuwe n'abaturage 31 966.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbumenyi bw\u2019isi.\nUmurenge wa Sovu ufite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 54,67. Uhana imbibi n\u2019imirenge ya Bwira, Kageyo na Kavumu. Ahenshi muri Sovu hari imisozi miremire n\u2019amashyamba.\nUtugari.\nUmurenge wa Sovu ugizwe n'utugari 6:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Sovu wari utuwe n'abaturage 26 855. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 31 966. Ubucucike bwari abantu 585 kuri kilometero kare.\nUbukungu.\nAkarere ka Ngororero gahinga icyayi n\u2019ikawa. Imiterere y\u2019ubutaka n\u2019ikirere byo muri Sovu ibereye ubuhinzi bw\u2019icyayi. Ni na ko bimeze muri Kageyo, Kavumu na Muhanda.\nGuhera mu 2018\u20132019, Akarere ka Ngororero kahaye amakoperative y\u2019urubyiruko inkunga y\u2019amatungo. Muri Sovu, amakoperative y\u2019urubyiruko yahawe ingurube. Ntiyahawe inkoko kubera ubutumburuke n\u2019imbeho. Amwe muri ayo makoperative yahuye n\u2019ibibazo byinshi."}
{"id": "7518", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=7518", "title": "Umurenge wa Kiziguro", "text": "Umurenge wa Kiziguro ni umwe mu mirenge 14 igize Akarere ka Gatsibo, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba, mu Rwanda. Ugizwe n'utugari 4.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Kiziguro wari utuwe n'abaturage 39 757. Muri uyu murenge hari Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kiziguro.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari.\nUmurenge wa Kiziguro ni umwe mu mirenge 14 y'Akarere ka Gatsibo. Ugizwe n'utugari 4:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Kiziguro wari utuwe n'abaturage 29 996. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 39 757.\nAmateka.\nMu 1994, Kiziguro yari muri Komini Murambi. Ku wa 11 Mata 1994, mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, Abatutsi bari bahungiye kuri Kiliziya ya Paruwasi Gatolika ya Kiziguro barishwe.\nMuri uyu murenge hari Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kiziguro."}
