{"id": "7538", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=7538", "title": "Sung Jae-ki", "text": "Sung Jae-ki cyangwa Sung Jae-gi(izina mu gikoreya: \uc131\uc7ac\uae30, izina mu gishinwa: \u6210\u5728\u57fa, 11 Nzeri 1967 - 26 Nyakanga 2013) ni Human right activists and Civil right activists, Liberalism Philosopher wa Koreya y\u2019Amajyepfo. muri 2008, founder ni Association wa Koreya Abagabo(\ub0a8\uc131\uc5f0\ub300 \u7537\u6027\u9023\u5e36).\nmuri 2013, Yari ni suicide, Protest wa sexual discrimination wa Koreya y\u2019Amajyepfo."}
