{"id": "7823", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=7823", "title": "Umurenge wa Rutunga", "text": "Umurenge wa Rutunga ni umwe mu mirenge 15 igize Akarere ka Gasabo, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Rutunga wari utuwe n'abaturage 22 468. Ugizwe n'utugari 6. Muri uyu murenge hari urwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'utugari.\nUmurenge wa Rutunga ni umwe mu mirenge 15 y'Akarere ka Gasabo. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 42,71. Ugizwe n'utugari 6:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Rutunga wari utuwe n'abaturage 17 906. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 22 468. Abagabo bari 10 865. Abagore bari 11 603. Abaturage bose batuye mu cyaro.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside.\nMu Murenge wa Rutunga hari urwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Ku rwibutso rwa Rutunga habarurwa abazize Jenoside 141."}
