{"id": "7914", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=7914", "title": "Umurenge wa Niboye", "text": "Umurenge wa Niboye ni umwe mu mirenge 10 igize Akarere ka Kicukiro, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Niboye wari utuwe n'abaturage 26 912. Ugizwe n'utugari 3.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'utugari.\nUmurenge wa Niboye ni umwe mu mirenge 10 y'Akarere ka Kicukiro. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 5,03. Ugizwe n'utugari 3:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Niboye wari utuwe n'abaturage 26 197. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 26 912. Abagabo bari 13 652. Abagore bari 13 260. Abaturage bose batuye mu mujyi."}
