{"id": "7920", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=7920", "title": "Irebenet.com", "text": "irebenet.com ni website yakorewe mu rwanda kandi ikaba inatangaza inkuru ziri mu kinyarwanda. iyi website yakozwe numuntu bita Niyitanga Jean muri bibiri na cumi na gatanu (2015). irebenet.com ni website yubatswe ku buryo bugoye kuko yatangiye gukorwa na Niyitanga wenyine.gusa yaje kunjyenda yongeramo abakozi bitewe nuko yari afite akazi kenshi ko gukora; kuko uko bwije nuko bukeye niko icyari igitekerezo cyo kwandika inkuru; cyagiye cyaguka atangira gukora online marketing; nyuma nko mu mwaka w2017 yaje gukora sistemu ya kaminuza yigagamo(university of Rwanda nyarugenge campus) y'itumanaho;nyuma yaho gato mu ntangiriro zumwaka w2018 nibwo yaje gukora indi system yo kwamamaza akoresheje imikino ikinirwa ku mafoto, akaba ari nawe wahanze ubu buryo bwo kwamamaza ku isi yose. mu mwaka w2015 yigaga mu mwaka wa 5 mu mashuli yisumbuye mu ishami rya MPC mu kigo kiba i kanombe mu mugi wa kigali cyitwa efotec;akaba ari nabwo yashyize hanze urubuga rwe; yaje kurangiza mu w2016, atsinda neza kuburyo bamuhauye buruse yo kwiga muri kaminuza muri 2017/2018."}
{"id": "7921", "revid": "9914", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=7921", "title": "Niyitanga Jean", "text": "Niyitanga Jean uzwi ku izina rya The great sophisticated cyagwa kuri best in perfects.\nakaba yaravutse mu mwaka w1999, akaba ari umwana wa gatandatu mu muryango wabana 12 avukana nabo. akaba abana n'ababyeyi be mu mugi wa musanze rwagati akaba ari naho yabarizwaga mbere yo mu mwaka wa 2017."}
