{"id": "7940", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=7940", "title": "Umurenge wa Jali", "text": "Umurenge wa Jali ni umwe mu mirenge 15 igize Akarere ka Gasabo, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda. Ugizwe n'utugari 7.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Jali wari utuwe n'abaturage 41 156. Muri uyu murenge hari urwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'utugari.\nUmurenge wa Jali ni umwe mu mirenge 15 y'Akarere ka Gasabo. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 37,37. Ugizwe n'utugari 7:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Jali wari utuwe n'abaturage 25 057. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 41 156.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside.\nMu Murenge wa Jali hari urwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Ku rwibutso rwa Jali habarurwa abazize Jenoside barenga 25 023."}
{"id": "7944", "revid": "15375", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=7944", "title": "Umwami Fay\u00e7al", "text": "Faisal Bin Abdulaziz Al Saud (\"\"; 14 Mara 1906 \u2013 25 Werurwe 1975) yari umwami wa Arabiya Sawudite guhera taliki ebyiri (2) z' ukwezi kwa cumi na kumwe (11) mu 1964 kugeza kuri makumyabiri n' eshanu (25) Werurwe (ukwezi kwa gatatu) mu 1975. \nYakoze ibikorwa bitandukanye mu kuzamura imibereho myiza y' Abanyafurika harimo nk'ibitaro bikomeye biri mu Rwanda byaje kumwitirirwa."}
