{"id": "7990", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=7990", "title": "Umurenge wa Muhoza", "text": "Umurenge wa Muhoza ni umwe mu mirenge 15 igize Akarere ka Musanze, mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Muhoza wari utuwe n'abaturage 69 741. Abenshi muri bo batuye mu mujyi. Umurenge wa Muhoza ugizwe n'utugari 4.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari.\nAkarere ka Musanze kagizwe n'imirenge 15, utugari 68 n'imidugudu 432. Umurenge wa Muhoza ugizwe n'utugari 4 n'imidugudu 26. Utugari tw'Umurenge wa Muhoza ni utu:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Muhoza wari utuwe n'abaturage 51 878. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 69 741. Abagabo bari 35 311. Abagore bari 34 430. Abaturage 65 700 batuye mu mujyi. Abaturage 4 041 batuye mu cyaro."}
{"id": "7996", "revid": "17923", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=7996", "title": "Umubumbe wa Mars", "text": "Umubumbe wa Mars (ikimenyetso:) ni umwe mu icyenda igaragiye izuba ukaba wegeranye n\u2019uwacu w\u2019isi.\nNi umubumbe wa kane uvuye ku izuba, kandi ukaba umubumbe wa kabiri muto nyuma ya Mercury.\nMu cyongereza bawita \"Roman God of War\",(Kinyarwanda: Imana y'Intambara y'Abaromani), Bawita kandi \"Umubumbe Utukura\" kubera ibara ryawo ritukura rigaragarira amaso ya muntu Nta bindi bikoresho byifashishijwe.\nMars kandi, Niho cumbi rya Olympus Mons, Ikirunga Kinini cyane kurusha ibindi kandi kikaba n'Umusozi wa kabiri muremure cyane Muri Sisiteme y'Izuba.\nKuri Mars haba Ukwezi kwa Phobos n'ukwa Deimos. Phobos na Deimos ni Amezi abiri afite ishusho nto kandi Itaringaniye, Bishoboka ko yombi (Phobos na Deimos), Akomoka ku ma Asteroids yafashwe kuri Mars nkuko byagenze kuri 5261 Eureka, Trojan yo"}
