{"id": "8018", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8018", "title": "Umurenge wa Bumbogo", "text": "Umurenge wa Bumbogo ni umwe mu mirenge 15 igize Akarere ka Gasabo, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda. Ugizwe n'utugari 7.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Bumbogo wari utuwe n'abaturage 112 899.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari.\nUmurenge wa Bumbogo ni umwe mu mirenge 15 y'Akarere ka Gasabo. Ugizwe n'utugari 7:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Bumbogo wari utuwe n'abaturage 35 381. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 112 899."}
{"id": "8019", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8019", "title": "Umurenge wa Nyundo", "text": "Umurenge wa Nyundo ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Rubavu, mu Ntara y'Uburengerazuba, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Nyundo wari utuwe n'abaturage 42 305. Ni ho hari icyicaro cya Diyosezi Gatolika ya Nyundo.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nImiterere.\nUmurenge wa Nyundo ni umwe mu mirenge 12 y'Akarere ka Rubavu. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 31,5. Uhana imbibi n'imirenge ya Nyamyumba, Rugerero, Kanama na Nyakiriba.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Nyundo wari utuwe n'abaturage 30 417. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 42 305. Abagore bari 52,6 %, abagabo bari 47,4 %. Abaturage 41,9 % bari bafite munsi y'imyaka 15. Ubucucike bwari abaturage 1 343 kuri km\u00b2. Abaturage 39,5 % bari batuye mu mujyi, abandi 60,5 % batuye mu cyaro.\nAhantu hazwi.\nNyundo ni icyicaro cya Diyosezi Gatolika ya Nyundo. Katedrali yayo yitwa Notre-Dame de l'Annonciation.\nMu Murenge wa Nyundo hari Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyundo. Uru rwibutso ruri hagati ya Seminari Nto ya Nyundo na Lyc\u00e9e Notre-Dame d'Afrique."}
