{"id": "8024", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8024", "title": "Akarere ka Gisagara", "text": "Akarere ka Gisagara ni kamwe mu turere umunani tugize Intara y'Amajyepfo mu Rwanda. Gahana imbibi n'Uburundi. Gafite ubuso bwa 679 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 397 051. Kagizwe n'imirenge 13.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'imbibi.\nAkarere ka Gisagara gaherereye mu majyepfo y'Intara y'Amajyepfo. Mu majyepfo no mu burasirazuba, gahana imbibi n'Uburundi. Mu majyaruguru hari Akarere ka Nyanza. Mu burengerazuba hari uturere twa Nyaruguru na Huye.\nAkarere kagizwe n'imirenge 13, utugari 59 n'imidugudu 524. Gafite ubuso bwa 679 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 397 051. Ubucucike ni abaturage 584 kuri km\u00b2. Icyicaro cy'akarere kiri i Ndora.\nImirenge.\nAkarere ka Gisagara kagizwe n'imirenge 13:"}
