{"id": "8033", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8033", "title": "Umurenge wa Kacyiru", "text": "Umurenge wa Kacyiru ni umwe mu mirenge 15 igize Akarere ka Gasabo, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda. Ugizwe n'utugari 3.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Kacyiru wari utuwe n'abaturage 30 036.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'utugari.\nUmurenge wa Kacyiru ni umwe mu mirenge 15 y'Akarere ka Gasabo. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 5,78. Ugizwe n'utugari 3:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Kacyiru wari utuwe n'abaturage 37 088. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 30 036. Umubare w'abaturage wagabanutse hagati ya 2012 na 2022."}
{"id": "8034", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8034", "title": "Umurenge wa Muganza", "text": "Umurenge wa Muganza ni umwe mu mirenge 18 igize Akarere ka Rusizi, mu Ntara y'Iburengerazuba y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Muganza wari utuwe n'abaturage 32 849. Ugizwe n'utugari 3. Uruganda rwa CIMERWA rukora sima ruri muri uyu murenge.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari.\nUmurenge wa Muganza ni umwe mu mirenge 18 y'Akarere ka Rusizi. Ugizwe n'utugari 3:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Muganza wari utuwe n'abaturage 27 344. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 32 849. Abagabo bari 15 608. Abagore bari 17 241.\nAbaturage 32 421 batuye mu mujyi. Abaturage 428 batuye mu cyaro.\nUbukungu.\nUruganda rwa CIMERWA rukora sima ruri mu Murenge wa Muganza.\nIkibaya cya Bugarama gihingwamo umuceri. Abahinzi bo muri iki kibaya baturuka mu mirenge ya Bugarama, Gikundamvura, Nyakabuye na Muganza.\nMu 2024, icyicaro cy\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abahinzi b\u2019umuceri bo mu kibaya cya Bugarama cyari mu Murenge wa Muganza."}
{"id": "8035", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8035", "title": "Laptop imwe kuri buri mwana (OLPC)", "text": "Mudasobwa imwe kuri buri mwana (in English One Laptop per Child or OLPC) ni gahunda ya Leta idaharanira inyungu yashyizweho ifite intego yo guhindura uburezi bw\u2019 abana ku isi. Iyi ntego yari kugerwaho aruko hakozwe kandi Hagakwirakwizwa ibikoresho by\u2019uburezi mu isi ikiri munzira y\u2019amajyambere ndetse hagashyirwamo porogaramu ninyigisho muribyo bikoresho.\u00a0 \n\u00a0 Intego yayo nyamukuru ikomeje kuba guhindura uburezi muguha ubushobozi abana bo mubihugu bikiri munzira y\u2019amajyambere kugira uburenzira kunyigisho, amakuru, naho gukorera porogaramu za mudasobwa. Mugihe iyi gahunda yatangizwaga, igiciro fatizo kuri mudasobwa yari amadolari arenga igihumbi y\u2019Amerika ($1,000 US), bityo ntibyari gushoboka kugera kuriyi ntego uretse gukora imashini zihendutse. Iyi yabaye mudasobwa ya OLPC XO, ifite igiciro gito kandi zikoresha n\u2019umuriro muke. Mwitangira umushinga waterwaga inkunga itagizwe n\u2019amafaranga n\u2019abagize imiryango nka AMD, eBay, Google, Marvell Technology Group, News Corporation, Nortel. Chi Mei Corporation, Red Hat, na Quanta.\u00a0\nUmushinga wa OLPC washimwe henshi ndetse uba ntamakemwa. Uyu mushinga washimwe kubw\u2019imashini zigiciro gito, zikoresha umuriro muke, ndetse wizeza ubufatanye mu rwego rwa za Minisiteri mu bihugu byinshi aho za mudasobwa zikoreshwa nka kimwe mu ishingiro ry\u2019uburezi, gushyiraho ahantu hafasha gukoresha mudasobwa nta kijijinganya mu rurimi urwo arirwo rwose ndetse byumwihariko nta bumenyi mu rurimi rw\u2019icyongereza. Bakiriye ibitekerezo byinshi harimo ibirebana na gahunda yabo, ndetse nibijyanye n\u2019uburyo bwabo nk\u2019imfashanyo, kuzikoresha muburyo bworoshye, umutekano wazo, ibizikorerwaho nubuzima bwite bwabyo.\u00a0\nAbayobozi b\u2019Ibihugu bimwe na bimwe bavugiye kumugaragaro kubijyanye numwihariko w\u2019igiciro cyuyu mushinga, kubijyanye n\u2019umuco ndetse nibihabwa agaciro ugereranyije nibikenewe n\u2019abaturage by\u2019ibanze mubihugu bikiri munzira y\u2019amajyambere."}
