{"id": "8042", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8042", "title": "Umurenge wa Nyakariro", "text": "Nyakariro ni umwe mu mirenge 14 igize Akarere ka Rwamagana, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu 2022, Umurenge wa Nyakariro wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 37 538. Umurenge wa Nyakariro ugizwe n\u2019utugari dutanu. Mu 2017, i Rwimbogo hatashywe umudugudu w\u2019icyitegererezo.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbumenyi bw\u2019isi.\nUmurenge wa Nyakariro uri mu Karere ka Rwamagana. Akarere ka Rwamagana gafite imirenge 14. Ubuso bw\u2019Umurenge wa Nyakariro ni kilometero kare 50,03. Umurenge wa Nyakariro ugizwe n\u2019utugari dutanu:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Nyakariro wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 20 196. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, abaturage bari 37 538. Muri bo, abagabo bari 18 145. Abagore bari 19 393. Abana bari munsi y\u2019imyaka 15 bari 14 593. Abaturage 22 256 babaga mu cyaro. Abaturage 15 282 babaga mu mujyi. Mu 2022, ku kilometero kare imwe habaga abaturage 750.\nUbukungu n\u2019ibikorwa remezo.\nMu 2017, mu Murenge wa Nyakariro hatashywe umudugudu w\u2019icyitegererezo wa Rwimbogo. Uwo mudugudu wagombaga kubakwamo inzu 85 zo mu buryo bwa \u00ab4 in 1\u00bb. Wagombaga kandi kubakwamo inzu 31 zo mu buryo bwa \u00ab2 in 1\u00bb. Izo nzu zagombaga kubakwa mu myaka itanu. Byari biteganyijwe ko zizatwara miliyoni 800 z\u2019amafaranga y\u2019u Rwanda. Muri uwo mudugudu hateganyijwe kandi ivuriro, amashuri, agakiriro, ikibuga n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019ikoranabuhanga.\nMu 2022, umuyoboro w\u2019amazi wa Gahengeri na Nyakariro wari wuzuye."}
