{"id": "8047", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8047", "title": "Umurenge wa Murambi", "text": "Umurenge wa Murambi ni umwe mu mirenge 17 igize Akarere ka Rulindo, mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Murambi wari utuwe n'abaturage 27 283. Ugizwe n'utugari 4.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari.\nAkarere ka Rulindo kagizwe n'imirenge 17, utugari 71 n'imidugudu 494. Umurenge wa Murambi ugizwe n'utugari 4:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Murambi wari utuwe n'abaturage 17 892. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 27 283. Abagabo bari 13 293. Abagore bari 13 990. Abaturage 9 082 batuye mu mujyi. Abaturage 18 201 batuye mu cyaro."}
{"id": "8049", "revid": "9535", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8049", "title": "Roubaix", "text": "Umujyi wa Roubaix (izina mu gifaransa: \"Roubaix\" ; izina mu giholandi: \"Robaais\") n'umujyi w'Ubufaransa mu majyaruguru y'igihugu, hafi y'umupaka w'Ububiligi. Mu mwaka wa 2013, umujyi wa Roubaix wari ufite abaturage 95,866."}
