{"id": "8111", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8111", "title": "Fondation Kizito Mihigo pour la Paix", "text": "Fondation Kizito Mihigo pour la Paix bakunze kwita Fondation KMP, ni umuryango utari uwa Leta washinzwe mu mwaka wa 2010 n'umuhanzi Kizito Mihigo. Intego yawo ni \nuguharanira amahoro n'ubwiyunge nyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe abatutsi muri 1994 \nIbikorwa.\nGuhera mu mwaka wa 2011, ku bufatanye na Ambassade ya Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika hamwe n'umuryango World Vision International, Fondation KMP yatangiye ubukangurambaga mu mashuri yo mu Rwanda no muri za gereza zose zo mu gihugu. Muri Kanama 2011 Kizito Mihigo yahawe igihembo na Madamu Jeannette Kagame kubera ibikorwa by'iyi fondation biharanira amahoro n'ubwiyunge \nMuri Werurwe 2013, KMP yahawe igihembo igihembo n'Ikigo cy'igihugu cy'imiyoborere (RGB) nk'umwe mu miryango itari iya Leta ikora ibikorwa bifasha igihugu mu miyoborere myiza\nFondation KMP yahagaritse ibikorwa byayo muri Mata 2014 ubwo umuhanzi Kizito Mihigo yafungwaga na Leta ashinjwa ibyaha byo gushaka guhirika ubutegetsi bwa FPR Inkotanyi, na Perezida wa Repuburika Paul Kagame "}
{"id": "8112", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8112", "title": "Amahigi", "text": "Amahigi Ni amagambo yifashishwaga n'abanyarwanda bakera, Bari guhiga inyamaswa. Aya magambo akaba yarari mu rujyano rwimvikana ko Ari indirimbo zo kubatera umurava, kugira ngo bataruha cg bakarambirwa Dore ko byabaga bitoroshye kubona inyamaswa ngo uyice. Bivugwa ko kurubu haruduce tumwe na tumwe nko muburengera zuba no mumajyaruguru hagikoreshwa amagorane ariko mu rwego rwo gususurutsa abana, nkibusakuzo cg mu bitaramo byumugoroba."}
{"id": "8115", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8115", "title": "Umurenge wa Karangazi", "text": "Umurenge wa Karangazi ni umwe mu mirenge 14 igize Akarere ka Nyagatare, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba y'u Rwanda. Uhana imbibi na Pariki y'Akagera.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Karangazi wari utuwe n'abaturage 96 915. Ni wo murenge ufite abaturage benshi mu Karere ka Nyagatare.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'abaturage.\nUmurenge wa Karangazi ufite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 550,3. Mu 2012, wari utuwe n'abaturage 57 444. Mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 96 915. Muri bo, abagabo ni 48 020, abagore ni 48 895. Abaturage 27 343 baba mu mujyi. Abandi 69 572 baba mu cyaro. Ubucucike ni abantu 176 kuri kilometero kare.\nUmurenge wa Karangazi ni wo ufite abaturage benshi mu mirenge 14 y'Akarere ka Nyagatare.\nUbukungu.\nUmurenge wa Karangazi n'Umurenge wa Rwimiyaga ni yo mirenge y'Akarere ka Nyagatare ihana imbibi na Pariki y'Akagera. Amafaranga Akarere ka Nyagatare gahabwa avuye muri pariki agenewe iyo mirenge yombi.\nMu Murenge wa Karangazi hari aborozi b'inka z'amata."}
