{"id": "8121", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8121", "title": "Umurenge wa Kabarondo", "text": "Kabarondo ni umujyi n\u2019umurenge byo mu Repubulika y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAho iherereye.\nKabarondo iherereye mu Akarere ka Kayonza, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba. Iri mu majyepfo y\u2019iburasirazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda, ku muhanda mukuru RN3 uva i Kigali ukagera i Nyakasanza muri Tanzaniya. Kabarondo iri ku ntera y\u2019umuhanda ingana na kilometero 83 mu majyepfo y\u2019iburasirazuba bwa Kigali, umurwa mukuru n\u2019umujyi munini w\u2019u Rwanda. Kabarondo iherereye ku nganyagihugu za 2\u00b000\u203238\u2033 S na 30\u00b033\u203227\u2033 E, ni ukuvuga ku bubangikane bwa \u22122.010556 no ku burebure bwa 30.557500.\nAhantu h\u2019ingenzi.\nAhantu h\u2019ingenzi hari muri Kabarondo cyangwa hafi yayo ni aha:"}
