{"id": "8171", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8171", "title": "Umurenge wa Gasaka", "text": "Umurenge wa Gasaka ni umwe mu mirenge 17 igize Akarere ka Nyamagabe, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Gasaka wari utuwe n'abaturage 41 558. Ibiro by'Akarere ka Nyamagabe biri muri uyu murenge. Mu 2024, Umurenge wa Gasaka wahembwe imodoka kubera isuku n'umutekano.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAbaturage.\nUmurenge wa Gasaka ni umwe mu mirenge 17 y'Akarere ka Nyamagabe. Ibiro by'Akarere ka Nyamagabe biri mu Murenge wa Gasaka, mu Kagari ka Nyamugari.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Gasaka wari utuwe n'abaturage 41 522. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 41 558. Abagabo bari 19 489. Abagore bari 22 069.\nAbaturage 29 582 batuye mu mujyi. Abaturage 11 976 batuye mu cyaro.\nIsuku n'umutekano.\nMu 2024, Umurenge wa Gasaka warushije indi mirenge mu bikorwa by'isuku n'umutekano. Wahembwe imodoka. Iyo modoka yashyikirijwe ubuyobozi bw'umurenge ku wa 19 Kamena 2024.\nMu bikorwa byatumye umurenge uhabwa icyo gihembo harimo gutunganya ingo, kugira uturima tw\u2019imboga n\u2019ibiti by\u2019imbuto, gusukura udusantere tw\u2019ubucuruzi no kwitabira amarondo. Ibigo by\u2019amashuri n\u2019ibigo by\u2019ubuvuzi byahinze imbuto n\u2019ibihumyo kugira ngo birwanye igwingira mu bana."}
