{"id": "8244", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8244", "title": "Umurenge wa Nyagihanga", "text": "Nyagihanga ni umwe mu mirenge 14 igize Akarere ka Gatsibo, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu 2022, Umurenge wa Nyagihanga wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 28 812. Abaturage bose babaga mu cyaro. Muri uyu murenge hari Ishuri ribanza rya Mayange. Mu 2025, hubakwaga ikiraro gifasha abahinzi kugeza umusaruro ku isoko.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbumenyi bw\u2019isi.\nUmurenge wa Nyagihanga uri mu Karere ka Gatsibo. Akarere ka Gatsibo gafite imirenge 14. Umurenge wa Nyagihanga ugizwe n\u2019utugari. Tumwe muri two ni Kibare, Mayange na Nyamirama.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Nyagihanga wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 24 159. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, abaturage bari 28 812. Muri bo, abagabo bari 13 858. Abagore bari 14 954. Abana bari munsi y\u2019imyaka 15 bari 10 522. Abaturage bose babaga mu cyaro.\nUbukungu n\u2019ibikorwa remezo.\nAbahinzi bo mu Murenge wa Nyagihanga bagiraga ikibazo cyo kugeza umusaruro ku isoko. Mu gihe cy\u2019imvura, umugezi wuzuraga. Amazi yangizaga imyaka. Mu 2025, hubakwaga ikiraro kuri uwo mugezi. Abaturage bagize uruhare mu kucyubaka. Ikiraro kizafasha abaturage bo mu tugari twa Kibare, Nyamirama na Mayange.\nUburezi.\nIshuri ribanza rya Mayange riri mu Kagari ka Mayange. Mu 2018 no mu 2019, umuryango Food for the Hungry (FH Rwanda) wubakiye iri shuri ibyumba by\u2019amashuri umunani. Uyu mushinga wari ufite agaciro ka miliyoni 70 z\u2019amafaranga y\u2019u Rwanda. Mu 2019, iri shuri ryari rifite abanyeshuri barenga 700."}
{"id": "8248", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8248", "title": "Umurenge wa Shyogwe", "text": "Umurenge wa Shyogwe ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Muhanga, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Shyogwe wari utuwe n'abaturage 50 966. Abaturage benshi b'uyu murenge batuye mu mujyi.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAbaturage.\nUmurenge wa Shyogwe ni umwe mu mirenge 12 y'Akarere ka Muhanga.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Shyogwe wari utuwe n'abaturage 44 771. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 50 966. Abagabo bari 27 407. Abagore bari 23 559.\nAbaturage 33 573 batuye mu mujyi. Abaturage 17 393 batuye mu cyaro."}
{"id": "8255", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8255", "title": "Adolf Hitler", "text": "Adolf Hitler (Braunau am Inn, ku ya 20 Mata 1889-Berlin, ku ya 30 Mata 1945) Adolf Hitler yari Otirishiya umunyapolitiki, mu ideologue isonga mu y'Igihugu c'Umugambwe. Yabaye, demokarasi yatorewe, Chancellor wa Budage, ariko buhoro buhoro yakuyeho uburyo bwa gutandukana ububasha mu Leta German na agglutinating bo mu muntu be kuba \"wategekaga\" kimwe mu zikomeye cyane abanyagitugu mu kinyejana makumyabiri. Azayobora Ishyaka rya Gisosiyalisiti ry\u2019Abakozi b'Abadagekandi yari umuyobozi wa Reich ya gatatu. Ingengabitekerezo ya Gisosiyalisiti y\u2019igihugu yateye imbere mu gihe cya guverinoma ya Hitler yarimo ivangura rishingiye ku moko n\u2019ibitekerezo byibasiye cyane cyane Abayahudi, bikavamo Itsembabwoko. Icyakora, ivanguramoko ryatejwe imbere n\u2019Ubudage bw\u2019Abasosiyalisiti ry\u2019Abadage ryarimo andi moko nk\u2019abaswa kandi muri rusange, umuntu uwo ari we wese wabonaga ko atari Aryan, ashingiye ku gitekerezo cy\u2019ubuziranenge bw\u2019amoko Hitler yateje imbere mu gitabo cye \"Mein Kampf\". Ingengabitekerezo, leta y'Ubudage na Hitler ubwe barwanyaga abakomunisiti muri SSSR. Mu murima wa politiki mpuzamahanga, Hitler bigamije kugarura mu \"Manu gisirikare\" ya German bavuga turere bari batakaje nyuma y'Intambara ya Mbere y'Isi na gusenyuka mu Austro-Hungarian Empire."}
