{"id": "8265", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8265", "title": "Akarere ka Rulindo", "text": "Akarere ka Rulindo ni kamwe mu turere dutanu tugize Intara y'Amajyaruguru mu Rwanda. Gafite ubuso bwa 567 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 360 144. Kagizwe n'imirenge 17.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'imbibi.\nAkarere ka Rulindo gahana imbibi n'uturere twa Nyarugenge na Gasabo two mu Mujyi wa Kigali. Gahana kandi imbibi n'Akarere ka Kamonyi ko mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo. Mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru, gahana imbibi n'uturere twa Gakenke na Burera.\nAkarere kagizwe n'imirenge 17, utugari 71 n'imidugudu 494. Gafite ubuso bwa 567 km\u00b2. Gatuwe n'abaturage 360 144. Abagore ni 188 295, abagabo ni 171 849. Ubucucike ni abaturage 635 kuri km\u00b2.\nImirenge.\nAkarere ka Rulindo kagizwe n'imirenge 17:"}
