{"id": "8290", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8290", "title": "Umurenge wa Bigogwe", "text": "Umurenge wa Bigogwe ni umurenge wo mu Karere ka Nyabihu, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba y'u Rwanda. Uri mu misozi y'amajyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda. Bigogwe izwiho ubworozi bw'inka.\nMuri 2022, Umurenge wa Bigogwe wari utuwe n'abaturage 34 439. Kuva muri 2021, umushinga Ibere rya Bigogwe wakuruye ba mukerarugendo baza gusura inka.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAmateka.\nAbagogwe ni itsinda ry'Abatutsi bo mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda. Hagati ya Mutarama na Werurwe 1991, Abagogwe benshi barishwe. Human Rights Watch yavuze ko abasivili barenga 300 bishwe. Ubu bwicanyi bwitwa Ubwicanyi bwa Bagogwe.\nAbatutsi bo muri Bigogwe batotejwe kuva muri 1990. I Bigogwe hari ikigo cya gisirikare. Interahamwe zahawe imyitozo ya mbere muri icyo kigo. Muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, hafi y'abagabo bose n'urubyiruko rw'Abatutsi bo muri Bigogwe barishwe.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Bigogwe wari utuwe n'abaturage 31 657. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 34 439. Muri bo, abagabo bari 16 385, abagore bari 18 054. Abaturage 25 398 bari batuye mu gace k'umujyi. Abandi 9 041 bari batuye mu cyaro.\nUbukungu.\nBigogwe ifite inzuri nini. Ubworozi bw'inka ni bwo buranga uyu murenge. Bimwe muri izo nzuri biri mu Kagari ka Arusha.\nIbere rya Bigogwe ni umushinga w'ubukerarugendo. Witiriwe umusozi usa n'ibere. Watangijwe na Ngabo Alexis Karegeya muri Gicurasi 2021. Abashyitsi bakama inka. Banywa amata mashya. Banazamuka imisozi. Muri 2024, inka z'Inyambo zagaruwe i Bigogwe. Zari zimaze imyaka igera kuri 50 zitahaba.\nIbikorwa remezo.\nMuri 2014, amazi yabaga make mu gihe cy'impeshyi. Abaturage bamwe bakoraga urugendo rugera kuri km 4 bajya kuvoma. Umuhanda Shaba\u2013Vuga\u2013Kabatwa wari umaze kubakwa. Uhuza ako gace n'umuhanda wa kaburimbo."}
