{"id": "8321", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8321", "title": "Umurenge wa Nemba", "text": "Umurenge wa Nemba ni umwe mu mirenge 19 igize Akarere ka Gakenke, mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Nemba wari utuwe n'abaturage 16 854. Ugizwe n'utugari 4. Ibitaro bya Nemba biherereye muri uyu murenge.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari.\nAkarere ka Gakenke kagizwe n'imirenge 19, utugari 97 n'imidugudu 617. Umurenge wa Nemba ugizwe n'utugari 4:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Nemba wari utuwe n'abaturage 15 643. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 16 854. Abagabo bari 7 851. Abagore bari 9 003. Abaturage 2 588 batuye mu mujyi. Abaturage 14 266 batuye mu cyaro.\nIbikorwa remezo.\nIbitaro bya Nemba biherereye mu Kagari ka Mucaca. Ni bimwe mu bitaro bitatu by\u2019akarere biri mu Karere ka Gakenke. Ibindi ni Ibitaro bya Gatonde n\u2019Ibitaro bya Ruli. Ibitaro bya Nemba bitanga serivisi zirimo ubutabazi bwihutirwa, kubaga, kuvura abana no kubyaza."}
{"id": "8324", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8324", "title": "Umurenge wa Nyarugunga", "text": "Umurenge wa Nyarugunga ni umwe mu mirenge 10 igize Akarere ka Kicukiro, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Nyarugunga wari utuwe n'abaturage 49 247. Ugizwe n'utugari 3.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'utugari.\nUmurenge wa Nyarugunga ni umwe mu mirenge 10 y'Akarere ka Kicukiro. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 15,28. Ugizwe n'utugari 3:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Nyarugunga wari utuwe n'abaturage 40 057. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 49 247. Abagabo bari 24 018. Abagore bari 25 229. Abaturage bose batuye mu mujyi."}
{"id": "8327", "revid": "9535", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8327", "title": "Gihanga", "text": "Gihanga ni komine yintara ya Bubanza mu majyaruguru yuburengerazuba bwu Burundi. Umurwa mukuru uri mu mujyi wa Gihanga. Umurwa mukuru w'intara uherereye i Bubanza."}
{"id": "8328", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8328", "title": "Yuhi V Musinga", "text": "Yuhi V Musinga (1883 - 1944), amazina ye y'amavuko Musinga, yari umwe mu bategetsi ba nyuma b'ubwami bw'u Rwanda. Yabaye mwami (nyuma y\u2019iyicwa rya murumuna we basangiye se Mibambwe IV mu 1896, yashyigikiye kungurana ibitekerezo n\u2019abakoloni b\u2019Abadage, ariko ahura n\u2019ubuyobozi bw\u2019abakoloni bw\u2019Ababiligi igihe bwakiraga manda y\u2019Umuryango w\u2019ibihugu mu gutsindwa n\u2019Ubudage mu gihe intambara ya mbere y'isi yose.\nBuhoro buhoro yambura mwami uburenganzira bwe, ashaka gushyira idini Gatolika mu rukiko rwa Nyanza, Ababiligi barangije kwirukana umwami ku ya 12 Ugushyingo 1931 bashinjwa \"kwikunda no kwifuza\".\nKu ya 14 Ugushyingo, umwami yirukanywe mu gihugu cy\u2019abaturanyi cya Kongo mu Bubiligi, azarangiza iminsi ye i Moba, naho umuhungu we, igikomangoma Charles Rudahigwa, yitwa mwami wo mu Rwanda ku ya 16 Ugushyingo 1931 ku izina rya Mutara III Rudahigwa."}
{"id": "8329", "revid": "13151", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8329", "title": "Mutara III Rudahigwa", "text": "ibintu bitangaje k'uMwami Mutara III Rudahigwa.\nNakubwirako umwami Rudahigwa ari we wambere washakanye n'umwamikazi bagashyingiranwa imbere y'Imana; hari muri mutarama1942, Rudahigwa ni we mwami wa mbere u Rwanda rwagize wize akaba yarasimbuye se akiri kuntebe y'ishuri Rudahigwa kandi ya kundaga siporo ibyo byatumye ashinga ikipe ariyo bitaga' Amaregura' iyo kipe yari gizwe na batware kandi niwe mwami watunze imodoka, akagendera no mu ndege.\nUmwami Mutara III Rudahigwa yashakanye na Rosariya Gicanda, uyu akaba yarishwe igihe cya Genoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda 1994..\nRudahigwa yatabarijwe ku musozi wa Mwima i Nyanza ku wa 28 Nyakanga 1959."}
{"id": "8330", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8330", "title": "Kigeli V Ndahindurwa", "text": "Kigeli V Ndahindurwa niwe mwami wa nyuma w'uRwanda akaba yarabatijwe akitwa Jean-Baptiste Ndahindurwa.\nUbuzima bwa mbere n'uburere.\nKigeli yavutse kuya 29 kamena 1936\nI Kamembe, mu cyahoze hitwa Ruanda-Urundi, yima ingoma kuya \n28 nyakanga 1959 kugeza 28 mutarama 1961, mbere gato yuko Ububiligi butanga ubwigenge muri iki gihugu.\nMu buhungiro.\nIgihe yari mu buhungiro muri Amerika, ntabwo yigeze yima uburenganzira bwe bw'ingoma kandi yafatwaga nk'umwami wa Jura w'u Rwanda, ayobora umusingi utanga ubufasha bw'ikiremwamuntu ku Rwanda.\nGuverinoma y'u Rwanda yamwohereje muri Tanzaniya ku ya 2 Ukwakira 1961, nyuma aba muri Uganda na Kenya. Amerika yamuhaye ubuhungiro bwa politiki muri Nyakanga 1992 kandi yabaga muri Virginie kugeza apfuye mu gitondo cyo ku ya 16 Ukwakira 2016. Ibisigazwa bye byimuriwe mu Rwanda n'icyemezo cy'ubucamanza maze ahambwa ku ya 15 Mutarama 2017 mu karere ka Nyanza, hafi ya murumuna we Mutara III Rudahigwa."}
{"id": "8331", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8331", "title": "Kigeli IV Rwabugiri", "text": "Kigeli IV Rwabugiri (1840? - Ugushyingo 1895) yari umwami w'Ubwami bw'u Rwanda mu mpera z'ikinyejana cya 19. Yari umwe mu bami b'abaNyiginya baheruka ku ngoma yari ku butegetsi yari yarakomotse ku gisekuru cye mu binyejana bine byabanje kugeza kuri Yari umututsi ku izina ry'amavuko rya Rwabugiri. Niwe mwami wa mbere mu mateka y'u Rwanda waje guhura n'Abanyaburayi. Yashyizeho ingabo zifite intwaro yakuye mu Budage kandi abuza abanyamahanga benshi cyane cyane Abarabu kwinjira mu bwami bwe.\nRwabugiri yarushijeho kugenzura ubutaka, amatungo, n'abantu bo muri Afurika yo hagati. Rwabugiri ntiyashoboye kugeza ubutegetsi bwe ku bwiyongere bw'butaka gusa, ahubwo yanashimangiye ubutegetsi mu ntore za politiki zamenyekanye nk'Abatutsi b'amoko. Mbere, ahanini bari abatware baho ubu bari bagize umuyoboro wemerera Umwami kwubaka ubumwe bw'igihugu mukarere gashya.\nRwabugiri yabaye umwami hagati y'imyaka 1853-1895. Yatanze (yapfuye) mu Gushyingo 1895, ubwo yari mu rugendo muri Leta ya Kongo Yigenga, nyuma gato yo kuza k'umushakashatsi w\u2019umudage Count Gustav Adolf von G\u00f6tzen. Umuhungu we wamureraga, Mibambwe IV Rutarindwa, yatangajwe ko ari umwami ukurikira."}
{"id": "8332", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8332", "title": "Rosalie Gicanda", "text": "Rosalie Gicanda yavutse mu mwaka wa 1928 yitaba Imana kuwa 20 Mata 1994. Yari umwamikazi wa nyuma w\u2019u Rwanda, akaba umugore w'u Mwami Mutara III Rudahigwa. Yabaye umwamikazi kuwa 13 Mutarama 1942 kugeza taliki 25 Nyakanga 1959.\nAzwi mu mateka y'u Rwanda kubera ubuzima bwe bwaranzwe n'ubugwaneza.\nYamaze indi myaka ibiri gusa, ku ngoma ya Mwami Kigeli V Ndahindurwa kugeza irangiye mu 1961.\nAmakuru yo kwitaba Imana kwe.\nKu ya 20 Mata 1994, ubwo jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu mwaka w'1994 mu Rwanda yatangiraga ku mugaragaro i Butare, itsinda ry\u2019abasirikare bayobowe na Liyetona Pierre Bizimana, ryayobowe na Kapiteni Idelphonse Nizeyimana, ryashimuse uwahoze ari umwami hamwe n\u2019abandi bari batuye aho yari atuye.\nBahise bimura abari bajyanywe bunyago inyuma y'inzu ndangamurage y'igihugu barabarasa. Umwe mu barokotse ni umukobwa muto, waje kuvuga inkuru y'ubwo bwicanyi. Nyuma y'iminsi ibiri, nyina w'umwamikazi na we aricwa. Abisabwe n'umupadiri, Umuyobozi wa Butare, Kanyabashi, yakuye umurambo w'umwamikazi Gicanda maze ahambwa mu gikari iruhande rw'urugo rwe."}
{"id": "8337", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8337", "title": "Akarere ka Kamonyi", "text": "Akarere ka Kamonyi ni kamwe mu turere umunani tugize Intara y'Amajyepfo mu Rwanda. Gafite ubuso bwa 655,5 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 450 849. Kagizwe n'imirenge 12.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'imbibi.\nAkarere ka Kamonyi gahana imbibi n'uturere dutanu: Muhanga, Ruhango, Nyarugenge, Gakenke na Bugesera.\nAkarere kagizwe n'imirenge 12, utugari 59 n'imidugudu 317. Gafite ubuso bwa 655,5 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 450 849. Ubucucike ni abaturage 688 kuri km\u00b2. Ibiro by'akarere biri mu Murenge wa Gacurabwenge, mu Kagari ka Gihinga, mu Mudugudu wa Ryabitana.\nImirenge.\nAkarere ka Kamonyi kagizwe n'imirenge 12:\nAmateka n'ubukerarugendo.\nAkarere ka Kamonyi gafite ahantu nyaburanga hatandukanye. Ijuru rya Kamonyi riri mu Murenge wa Gacurabwenge. Aho ni ho Umwami Yuhi Mazimpaka yari atuye. Umuhungu we Cyirima Rujugira yatuye ku musozi wa Gaseke, mu Murenge wa Kayenzi. I Muganza, mu Murenge wa Karama, hari ishyamba ryashyingurwagamo abami.\nUbukungu.\nAkarere ka Kamonyi keramo imyumbati. Ubutaka bwahujwe ku buso bwa hegitari 2 800 bwo guhinga imyumbati."}
{"id": "8339", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8339", "title": "Umurenge wa Nyamugari", "text": "Nyamugari ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Kirehe, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu 2022, Umurenge wa Nyamugari wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 42 938. Abenshi muri bo babaga mu cyaro. Mu 2020, i Kiyanzi hashyizweho ahantu hakorerwa imirimo ya gasutamo. Abaturage bamwe bavoma amazi mu mugezi wa Kagera.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbumenyi bw\u2019isi.\nUmurenge wa Nyamugari uri mu Karere ka Kirehe. Akarere ka Kirehe gafite imirenge 12 n\u2019utugari 60. Ubuso bw\u2019Umurenge wa Nyamugari ni kilometero kare 97,94. Umurenge wa Nyamugari ugizwe n\u2019utugari. Tumwe muri two ni Kazizi na Kiyanzi.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Nyamugari wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 36 754. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, abaturage bari 42 938. Muri bo, abagabo bari 20 867. Abagore bari 22 071. Abana bari munsi y\u2019imyaka 15 bari 17 018. Abaturage 39 961 babaga mu cyaro. Abaturage 2 977 babaga mu mujyi. Mu 2022, ku kilometero kare imwe habaga abaturage 438.\nUbukungu n\u2019ibikorwa remezo.\nMu 2020, u Rwanda rwashyizeho ahantu hakorerwa imirimo ya gasutamo i Kiyanzi, mu Murenge wa Nyamugari. Kiyanzi iri ku muhanda uva i Rusumo ujya i Kigali. Abashoferi b\u2019amakamyo bambuka umupaka bahabona ububiko bw\u2019ibicuruzwa. Bahabona kandi aho kurara. Aha hantu hashyizweho mu ngamba zo kwirinda COVID-19.\nAbaturage bo mu Kagari ka Kiyanzi bagira ikibazo cy\u2019ibura ry\u2019amazi. Bavoma amazi mu mugezi wa Kagera, ku mupaka wa Rusumo. Mu 2022, mu Murenge wa Nyamugari hari ingomero ebyiri. Abahinzi bari biteze ko umushinga w\u2019Urugomero rwa Rusumo uzabafasha kuhira imyaka.\nMu 2023, abaturage bo mu Kagari ka Kazizi batangiye kubaka ibiro bishya by\u2019akagari. Babyubakaga mu muganda."}
{"id": "8340", "revid": "18951", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8340", "title": "Fred Rwigema", "text": "Fred Rwigema (wavutse tariki 10 Mata 1957 apfa tarki 02 Ukwakira 1990) yari umunyapolitiki n' umusirikare w' umunyarwanda. Amazina ye y' ivuko ni Fred GISA RWIGEMA. Ni umwe mu ntwari z' u Rwanda zaharaniye gutahura bamwe mu banyarwanda bari barahunze birukanywe mu gihugu cyabo kuva mu 1959. Kuri ubu RWIGEMA afatwa nk' Intwari mu bihugu nka Uganda na Mozambique kubera ibikorwa yahakoreye nk'umusirikari uko yagendaga abirwanirira.\nGISA ni umwe mu banyarwanda barenga ibihumbi bakuriye mu buhungiro.\nMu mwaka w' 1985, Rwigema yashinze ishyaka rya FPR (Rwanda Patriotic Front) riri kumwe n' umutwe w' ingabo wiswe RPA (Rwanda Patriotic Army)."}
{"id": "8341", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8341", "title": "Akarere ka Kirehe", "text": "Akarere ka Kirehe ni kamwe mu turere turindwi tugize Intara y'Iburasirazuba mu Rwanda. Gaherereye mu majyepfo y'iburasirazuba bw'u Rwanda. Gafite ubuso bwa 1 118,5 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 460 860. Kagizwe n'imirenge 12.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'imbibi.\nAkarere ka Kirehe kari ku birometero 133 uvuye mu Umujyi wa Kigali. Ibiro by'akarere biri mu Murenge wa Kirehe, mu Kagari ka Nyabikokora.\nUmugezi w'Akagera ni wo mupaka w'akarere na Tanzaniya mu burasirazuba. Mu majyepfo, akarere gahana imbibi n'Uburundi na Tanzaniya. Mu burengerazuba hari Akarere ka Ngoma. Mu majyaruguru hari Akarere ka Kayonza.\nAkarere kagizwe n'imirenge 12, utugari 60 n'imidugudu 612. Gafite ubuso bwa 1 118,5 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 460 860.\nImirenge.\nAkarere ka Kirehe kagizwe n'imirenge 12:\nUbukungu n'ubukerarugendo.\nUbukungu bw'akarere bushingiye ahanini ku buhinzi n'ubworozi. Mu Murenge wa Mushikiri, abahinzi b'ibitoki bagurisha toni zisaga 200 z'ibitoki buri kwezi. Muri 2025, abafatanyabikorwa b'akarere batanze miliyari 6 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda mu ngengo y'imari ya 2024/2025.\nAkarere ka Kirehe gafite umupaka mpuzamahanga wa Rusumo. Uyu mupaka uhuza u Rwanda na Tanzaniya. Mu karere hari amahoteli arimo East Gate Hotel na Matunda Resort Beach Hotel. Isumo rya Rusumo riri ku mupaka w'u Rwanda na Tanzaniya, mu mirenge ya Kigarama na Nyamugari."}
{"id": "8355", "revid": "12768", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8355", "title": "Bing Crosby", "text": "Harry Lillis Crosby (Tacoma, Amerika, Ku ya 3 Gicurasi 1903-Alcobendas, Espanye, ku ya 14 Ukwakira 1977), uzwi cyane ku izina rya Bing Crosby, yari umuririmbyi w'umunyamerika (crooner) akaba n'umukinnyi ufite umwuga w'ubuhanzi wo mu kinyejana cya kabiri yatekerezaga ko Inyenyeri ya mbere ya Multimedia, Bing Crosby nigikorwa cyagurishijwe cyane kandi cyatsinze cyane mu kinyejana cya 20 kwisi.\nCrosby yari umuyobozi mu kugurisha amajwi, kurutonde rwa radiyo, no kwinjiza amafaranga menshi - umwe mu bantu bakomeye kandi bakomeye bo mu kinyejana cya 20 ku isi. Yari umwe mu bahanzi ba mbere ba multimediya. Hagati ya 1934 na 1954, Crosby yari afite ibicuruzwa byiza cyane bidasanzwe hamwe na alubumu ye, amanota menshi kuri radiyo, ndetse na firime zizwi ku isi.\nAkenshi afatwa nkumwe mubakinnyi ba muzika bazwi cyane mumateka kandi nijwi ryabantu ryanditswe kuri elegitoroniki muri iki gihe.\nIcyamamare mu buhanzi bwa Crosby ni rusange, ni ngombwa cyane kuvuga ko yari umwe mu bashishikarije abandi basemuzi bakomeye b'abagabo bamushyigikiye, nka Frank Sinatra, Perry Como, Dean Martin, John Lennon, Elvis Presley, Michael Bubl\u00e9 Bamwe.\nBing Crosby yagurishije inyandiko zirenga miriyari 1 kwisi yose kugeza ubu3 4 birashoboka ko wagurishijwe cyane mumateka, ndetse nindirimbo yagurishijwe cyane kwisi yitwa Noheri yera, hamwe na kopi zirenga 50.000.000 zagurishijwe kwisi yose.5\nCrosby yari azwi cyane kandi azwi cyane hagati mu kinyejana cya 20 rwagati ku isi, ku buryo ubushakashatsi bwakozwe icyo gihe bwerekanye ko Crosby yari azwi cyane kandi yubahwa kurusha Papa Piyo wa XII icyo gihe.\nImbonerahamwe yatsindiye iracyashimishije: amakarita 396 ku giti cye, harimo 41 yakinnye. Niba ubaze inshuro nyinshi \"Noheri yera\" yatsinzwe, ibyo byazana iyo mibare igera kuri 43, kurusha The Beatles na Elvis Presley hamwe.\nCrosby yari afite imbonerahamwe zitandukanye buri mwaka hagati ya 1931 na 1954, wongeyeho afite inshuro 24 zitandukanye zizwi cyane muri 1939 wenyine.\nBing Crosby yafashe amajwi arenga 2000 yafashwe amajwi yubucuruzi hamwe na radio zigera ku 4000, hiyongereyeho urutonde runini rwerekana amafilime na televiziyo, niwe muhanzi wanditswe cyane mu mateka.\nBing Crosby yatsinze amanota 41 No 1 ku rutonde (43 harimo imitwe ya kabiri n'iya gatatu kuri \"Noheri yera\"), kurusha Beatles ifite (24) na Elvis Presley ufite (18).\nAmajwi ye yageze ku rutonde inshuro 396, arenga Frank Sinatra (209) na Elvis Presley (149) hamwe.\nCrosby yari ijwi ryindirimbo 13 zatowe na Oscar, enye muri zo zatsindiye igihembo cya Akademiki cyindirimbo nziza: \"Sweet Leilani\" (Ubukwe bwa Waikiki, 1937), \"Noheri yera\" (Holiday Inn, 1942), \"Swinging ku nyenyeri \"(Genda Inzira Yanjye, 1944), na\" Muri Cool, Cool, Cool of nimugoroba \"(Hano Haza Umukwe, 1951).\nBing Crosby yahawe inyenyeri eshatu kuri Walk Walk of Fame ya Hollywood: imwe yo gufata amajwi, imwe kuri radio, n'indi ya firime.\nBing Crosby niwe muhanzi wanditswe cyane mu mateka hamwe n\u2019indirimbo zigera kuri 400 zagurishijwe ku isi, ibyo bikaba byagezweho ko nta muntu urimo Frank Sinatra, Elvis Presley, The Beatles na Michael Jackson wegereye guhuza.\nCrosby yanditse amajwi ane muri Grammy Hall of Fame, iki kikaba ari igihembo kidasanzwe cyashinzwe mu 1973 mu rwego rwo guha icyubahiro amajwi \"afite ireme n'amateka\"."}
{"id": "8360", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8360", "title": "F\u00e9licit\u00e9 Niyitegeka", "text": "F\u00e9licit\u00e9 Niyitegeka (yavutse mu 1934) Ni Umubikira w'umunyarwandakazi ubarwa mu ntwari z'igihugu, yavukiye i Vumbi, mu cyahoze ari komini ya Runyinya, muri perefegitura ya Butare\nAmavu n'amavuko.\n. Ni bucura y'umuryango w'abana 10, F\u00e9licit\u00e9 yize mumashuri abanza ya Astrida, hanyuma yiga ayisumbuye mu ishuri rya Save mumashuri acungwa n'ababikira. Arangije amasomo ye mu myaka ya za 1950, F\u00e9licit\u00e9 yahawe inshingano yo kuba umwarimu n'umugenzuzi mu majyaruguru y'u Rwanda, mu ishuri rya Muramba. Icyo gihe yahawe na \u201cAuxiliaires de l'Apostolat\u201d, yitwa \u201cDemoiselles\u201d. Paruwasi ya Nyundo na seminari ya Nyundo yari imaze gushingwa ihabwa umwepiskopi w'umunyarwanda, Nyiricyubahiro Aloys Bigirumwami.\nF\u00e9licit\u00e9 yavukiye mu muryango ufite kwizera Gukomeye muri Kristo, ise Simon Sekabwa yari umukiristu bikomeye. F\u00e9licit\u00e9 yabaye umugore wa mbere w\u2019umunyafurika wabaye Auxiliaires de l'Apostolat2. Auxiliaires de l'Apostolat intego yabo ni ugukorana bya hafi na musenyeri, Auxiliaires de l'Apostolat bitwaga Kinyarwanda \"Abakobwa ba Musenyeri\", Nyiricyubahiro Bigirumwami yohereje F\u00e9licit\u00e9 i Lourdes kugira ngo ahugurwe, aho ikigo cy\u2019amahugurwa ku Isi cy\u2019abafasha ba Apostolate giherereye.\nUmwuga.\nTugarutse mu Rwanda, F\u00e9licit\u00e9 yabaye umwe mu bayobozi ba Auxiliaires de l'Apostolat. Umuyobozi wa mbere w\u2019ishuri rikuru \u201cNotre-Dame d'Afrique\u201d rya Nyundo, umwepiskopi yamwohereje i Lourdes mu 1963, kugira ngo ajyane nabandi bagenzi be bo muri Afurika bahugurirwe hamwe. Yagarutse nyuma y'imyaka itandatu ashingwa kuyobora ubuyobozi bwa Centre Saint Pierre, ikigo cya diyosezi cyari ishinzwe amahugurwa n\u2019umwiherero wa Auxiliaires de l'Apostolat. Icyubahiro cye cyambutse umupaka kugera i Goma, muri Zayire (Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo), aho yakoranye na bagenzi be..F\u00e9licit\u00e9 yahoraga yifuza kwitangira umurimo, cyane cyane ku babikeneye cyane. Yabigaragaje muri jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994.\nMu gukora urutonde rw'intwari z'igihugu, abayobozi basanze ubutwari bwe mubuzima bwe bwose bumwemerera kuba kurutonde maze yegurwa kuba intwari y'igihugu cy'u Rwanda. Ibi byatewe n'icyemezo cy'inama y'abaminisitiri yabaye ku ya 12 Nzeri 2011."}
{"id": "8361", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8361", "title": "Intwari irimbi ryigihugu", "text": "Bitandukanye n'inzibutso za jenoside nyinshi mu Rwanda, Urwibutso rw'Intwari z'igihugu i Kigali ntirushobora kugera ku bantu. Uruhushya rwihariye rutangwa na minisiteri y\u2019urubyiruko, siporo n\u2019umuco rurasabwa kugera kuri uru ruganda ruto rw\u2019imva n\u2019imva hafi ya stade Amahoro.\nIgitangaje kurushaho ni uko iyi atari urwibutso rwa jenoside gusa. Ahubwo, intwari icumi zibukiwe hano ziratandukanye na Jenerali Majoro Fred Rwigema, umuyobozi w'icyamamare w'ingabo z\u2019ingabo z\u2019inyeshyamba zo mu Rwanda (RPA) wishwe ku munsi wa kabiri RPA yateye u Rwanda mu Kwakira 1990; Agathe Uwilingiyimana, wahoze ari Minisitiri w\u2019intebe w\u2019Abahutu wishwe mu minsi ya mbere ya jenoside; n'abasirikare benshi batazwi.\nByinshi mu mva zabo byashushanywaga kuri marble yijimye yijimye kandi irimbishijweho zahabu. Bashyizwe mubutaka bunoze, bubungabunzwe neza nabarimyi babiri. Kurinda imva kubintu, ibisenge birinda bikingira hafi kurubuga rwose. Kurinda imva abacengezi, abarinzi babiri bitwaje imbunda barinda urwibutso igihe cyose. Agace gato kazengurutswe \"ikigo cyabashyitsi\" kirimo inzu yerekana ishusho yerekana hasi. Usibye amashusho yavuzwe nabandi,"}
{"id": "8362", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8362", "title": "Kungurana ibitekerezo", "text": "Guhana kwegereza ubuyobozi abaturage (DEX) ni uburyo bwo guhanahana amakuru bukora mu buryo bwo kwegereza ubuyobozi abaturage, ni ukuvuga, nta buyobozi bukuru. Kwegereza abaturage ubuyobozi byemerera urungano rw\u2019urungano rwo gucuruza amafaranga.\nKwinjira mu gitabo kuri Switcheo Guhana Kubera ko abakoresha badakeneye kohereza umutungo wabo mu kuvunja, guhana kwegereza ubuyobozi abaturage bigabanya ibyago by\u2019ubujura buva mu bucuruzi bw\u2019ivunjisha. Kwegereza abaturage ubuyobozi birashobora kandi gukumira ibicuruzwa biva mu mahanga cyangwa ibicuruzwa byahimbwe binyuze mu bucuruzi bwo gukaraba, kandi ntibizwi kuruta guhanahana gushyira mu bikorwa kumenya ibyo umukiriya wawe asabwa.\nHariho ibimenyetso bimwe byerekana ko kungurana ibitekerezo byegerejwe abaturage byagize ikibazo cy\u2019ubucuruzi buke ndetse n\u2019isoko ry\u2019isoko. Umushinga 0x, protocole yo kubaka ihererekanyabubasha hamwe no guhinduranya ibintu bigerageza gukemura iki kibazo.\nIngaruka.\nBitewe no kubura inzira ya KYC, kandi ntaburyo bwo guhindura ibikorwa, abakoresha barahomba niba bigeze bibasirwa ijambo ryibanga cyangwa urufunguzo rwihariye.\nImpamyabumenyi zo kwegereza ubuyobozi abaturage.\nKwegereza abaturage ubuyobozi birashobora kugira ibice bikomatanyirijwe hamwe, aho kugenzura kugenzura kuvunja bikiri mu maboko yubuyobozi bukuru. Urugero rugaragara ni IDEX ibuza abakoresha leta ya New York gushyira ibicuruzwa kuri platifomu.\nMuri Nyakanga 2018, Bancor yoherezwa mu nzego zegerejwe abaturage ngo yibwe kandi ihomba igihombo cy\u2019amadorari 13.5M mbere yo guhagarika amafaranga. Muri Tweet, Charlie Lee, uwashizeho Litecoin yagize icyo avuga avuga ko kuvunja bidashobora kwegerezwa abaturage niba bishobora gutakaza cyangwa guhagarika amafaranga y\u2019abakiriya.\nAbakora ibikorwa byo kungurana ibitekerezo byegerejwe abaturage barashobora guhura ningaruka zemewe n\u2019ubuyobozi bwa leta. Akarorero kamwe ni uwashinze EtherDelta, mu Gushyingo 2018 yakemuye ibirego muri komisiyo ishinzwe kugurizanya no kugurizanya muri Amerika ku bijyanye no gukora ivunjisha ritanditswe."}
{"id": "8366", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8366", "title": "Umurenge wa Nyakabanda", "text": "Umurenge wa Nyakabanda ni umwe mu mirenge 10 igize Akarere ka Nyarugenge, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Nyakabanda wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 29 580. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari 4. Abaturage bawo bose batuye mu mujyi.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari.\nUmurenge wa Nyakabanda ni umwe mu mirenge 10 y\u2019Akarere ka Nyarugenge. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari 4:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Nyakabanda wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 25 666. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 29 580. Abagabo bari 14 752. Abagore bari 14 828. Abaturage bose bari batuye mu mujyi."}
{"id": "8375", "revid": "81343", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8375", "title": "Melchior Ndadaye", "text": "Melchior Ndadaye (n. Murama, 28 Werurwe ya 1953 - Bujumbura, 21 Ukwakira ya [1993]]) yari umunyabwenge na umunyapolitiki Burundian wabaye uwa kane Perezida wa Repubulika y\u2019Uburundi kuva 10 Nyakanga kuva 1993 kugeza yiciwe ku ya 21 Ukwakira muri uwo mwaka. Yabaye umukuru wa mbere w\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburundi ukomoka abahutu, ubwoko bwinshi mu gihugu cye, akaba na perezida wa mbere yatowe mu buryo bwa demokarasi mu matora ataziguye mu amateka y\u2019Uburundi.\nNdadaye yaje ku butegetsi biturutse ku kugwa kwa leta ya gisirikare iyobowe n\u2019amoko mato Abatutsi mu rwego rw\u2019inzibacyuho ya demokarasi yakozwe na Perezida Pierre Buyoya, mu rwego rwo kubuza igihugu kugira a [[Intambara y'abanyarwanda | Ndadaye yatsinze Buyoya, umukandida w\u2019ishyaka rimwe kugeza icyo gihe UPRONA, mu matora ya 1 Kamena ya 1993 nk'umukandida wa FRODEBU. Ndadaye yagerageje gukora politiki ishyize mu gaciro igamije gushaka entente hagati y\u2019amoko yombi. Icyakora, ntabwo yari ishyigikiwe n\u2019imirenge ikaze abahutu, bakomeje ibikorwa byo guhungabanya umutekano n\u2019inyeshyamba na nyuma ya guverinoma ishingiye kuri demokarasi, kandi na yo yagombaga guhangana n\u2019abatavuga rumwe n\u2019ingabo z\u2019igihugu, ndetse no muri amaboko y'abatutsi, bakekaga ivugurura ryabo.\nNyuma y'amezi atatu gusa Ndadaye yimitswe, ku ya 21 Ukwakira, habaye yagerageje guhirika ubutegetsi, Nadadye asimburwa na Fran\u00e7ois Ngeze nk'umuyobozi ya leta \" de facto \". Kuri uwo munsi, perezida yajyanywe ku biro mu kigo cya gisirikare, aho yiciwe amaraso. Nubwo amaherezo ihirikwa ry\u2019ubutegetsi ryatsinzwe kandi guverinoma ishingiye ku itegekonshinga ikomeza guhagarara, iyicwa rya Ndadaye ryateje ubukana bwa politiki hagati y\u2019amoko yombi, bitangiza Intambara y'abenegihugu mu Burundi, izakomeza kugeza 2005. "}
{"id": "8380", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8380", "title": "Akarere ka Gasabo", "text": "Akarere ka Gasabo ni kamwe mu turere dutatu tugize Umujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda. Gafite ubuso bwa 430,3 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 879 505. Kagizwe n'imirenge 15.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'imbibi.\nAkarere ka Gasabo gaherereye mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bw'Umujyi wa Kigali. Mu majyepfo, gahana imbibi n'Akarere ka Kicukiro. Mu majyaruguru hari Akarere ka Gicumbi. Mu burasirazuba hari Akarere ka Rwamagana. Mu burengerazuba hari Akarere ka Nyarugenge.\nIcyicaro cy'akarere kiri mu Murenge wa Remera, mu Kagari ka Nyarutarama. Akarere kagizwe n'imirenge 15, utugari 73 n'imidugudu 485. Gafite ubuso bwa 430,3 km\u00b2. Muri 2022, kari gatuwe n'abaturage 879 505.\nImirenge.\nAkarere ka Gasabo kagizwe n'imirenge 15:"}
{"id": "8387", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8387", "title": "Akarere ka Bugesera", "text": "Akarere ka Bugesera ni kamwe mu turere turindwi tugize Intara y'Iburasirazuba mu Rwanda. Gaherereye mu majyepfo y'iburasirazuba bw'u Rwanda. Gahana imbibi n'Uburundi.\nAkarere ka Bugesera gafite ubuso bwa 1 337 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 551 103. Kagizwe n'imirenge 15.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'imbibi.\nAkarere ka Bugesera gahana imbibi n'Uburundi. Gahana kandi imbibi n'uturere twa Ngoma, Rwamagana, Kicukiro, Nyarugenge, Kamonyi, Ruhango na Nyanza.\nAkarere kagizwe n'imirenge 15, utugari 72 n'imidugudu 581. Gafite ubuso bwa 1 337 km\u00b2. Muri 2022, gafite abaturage 551 103.\nImirenge.\nAkarere ka Bugesera kagizwe n'imirenge 15:\nBuri kagari kayoborwa n'Umunyamabanga Nshingwabikorwa. Afatanya n'ushinzwe imibereho myiza n'iterambere (SEDO). Akagari ni rwo rwego rwegereye abaturage.\nKwibuka.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyamata ruri mu Karere ka Bugesera. Ruruhukiyemo imibiri y'abasaga 45 000. Bishwe muri Nyamata no mu nkengero zayo muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994.\nUbukungu n'ibikorwa remezo.\nAkarere ka Bugesera kari mu birometero 15 uvuye mu Mujyi wa Kigali.\nIkibuga muzamahanga cy'indege cya Bugesera kiri kubakwa mu Murenge wa Rilima. Muri 2019, sosiyete Qatar Airways yemeye gufata imigabane 60 % y'iki kibuga.\nMu Murenge wa Gashora hari inganda nyinshi. Muri zo harimo Imana Steel Rwanda, uruganda rukora ibyuma by'ubwubatsi. Mu Murenge wa Ntarama hari uruganda rukora amasabune n'impapuro z'isuku.\nAmazi n'amashanyarazi.\nMuri Mutarama 2025, mu Murenge wa Nyarugenge hatashywe ibikorwa remezo by'amazi. Byatwaye miliyoni 750 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda. Harimo umuyoboro w'amazi wa kilometero 28,2. Uwo muyoboro uha amazi abaturage basaga 11 400. Hubatswe kandi ibigega 2 n'amavomo 27. Amavomo 7 yari yarangiritse yarasanwe.\nMu Murenge wa Musenyi, ingo 292 zahawe umuriro w'amashanyarazi. Akarere kateganyaga ko abaturage bose bazaba bafite amashanyarazi mu 2024.\nImihanda n'amasoko.\nMuri Kanama 2024, hatangijwe imirimo yo gushyira kaburimbo ku mihanda 7 yo mu mujyi wa Nyamata. Iyo mihanda ifite uburebure bwa kilometero 2,1. Imirimo yari iteganyijwe kumara amezi 8.\nAkarere gafite amasoko menshi. Muri yo harimo isoko rya Nyamata, irya Ntarama, irya Musenyi n'irya Rilima.\nUbuhinzi n'ubworozi.\nAbaturage benshi b'Akarere ka Bugesera batunzwe n'ubuhinzi. Bahinga cyane cyane ibihingwa ngandurarugo. Muri byo harimo ibirayi, ibigori, soya, ibijumba, imyumbati, amateke, intoryi n'ingano. Bahinga kandi umuceri n'ikawa. Abahinzi bahura n'imbogamizi nyinshi. Muri zo harimo imihindagurikire y'ikirere, ubutaka busharira no kubura imbuto.\nAborozi borora inka, inkoko, intama, ihene n'imbata. Bahura n'imbogamizi zirimo kubura ubwatsi, kubura amazi, ibirondwe n'indwara. Mu Murenge wa Mayange hari umushinga wa ABUSOL wo korora inkoko zitanga amagi. Muri 2021, wari ufite inkoko zisaga 80 000.\nUburezi n'ubuzima.\nMu myaka 30 ishize, Akarere ka Bugesera kari gafite amashuri yisumbuye 2 gusa. Muri 2024, kari gafite amashuri yisumbuye 71. Icyo gihe, umuyobozi w'akarere yari Richard Mutabazi. Amashuri yigisha imyuga arimo Nelson Mandela TSS na Ruhuha VTC.\nIbitaro bya Nyamata bitanga serivisi z'ubuzima ku baturage 434 668 bo mu Karere ka Bugesera n'uturere duturanye. Bigenzura ibigo nderabuzima 15.\nImikino.\nBugesera FC ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru y'Akarere ka Bugesera."}
{"id": "8388", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8388", "title": "Umurenge wa Gatsibo", "text": "Umurenge wa Gatsibo ni umwe mu mirenge 14 igize Akarere ka Gatsibo, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba, mu Rwanda. Ugizwe n'utugari 4.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Gatsibo wari utuwe n'abaturage 40 940.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari.\nUmurenge wa Gatsibo ni umwe mu mirenge 14 y'Akarere ka Gatsibo. Ugizwe n'utugari 4:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Gatsibo wari utuwe n'abaturage 36 690. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 40 940."}
{"id": "8389", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8389", "title": "Akarere ka Kayonza", "text": "Akarere ka Kayonza ni kamwe mu turere turindwi tugize Intara y'Iburasirazuba mu Rwanda. Gafite ubuso bwa 1 935 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 457 156. Kagizwe n'imirenge 12. Ni amarembo ya Pariki y'Akagera.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAmateka.\nAkarere ka Kayonza kagizwe n'icyahoze ari uturere twa Rukara, Kabarondo na Cyarubare. Kagizwe kandi n'imirenge 2 yahoze ari iy'Akarere ka Muhazi: Nyagatovu na Mukarange.\nUbuso n'imbibi.\nAkarere ka Kayonza gahana imbibi n'Akarere ka Rwamagana mu burengerazuba n'Akarere ka Gatsibo mu majyaruguru. Gahana kandi imbibi n'uturere twa Ngoma na Kirehe, n'igihugu cya Tanzaniya.\nAkarere kagizwe n'imirenge 12, utugari 50 n'imidugudu 421. Gafite ubuso bwa 1 935 km\u00b2. Muri 2022, gafite abaturage 457 156, ni ukuvuga abaturage 236 kuri km\u00b2. Kazwiho ahantu nyaburanga, imisozi, ibiyaga n'amashuri menshi.\nImirenge.\nAkarere ka Kayonza kagizwe n'imirenge 12:\nUbukerarugendo.\nAkarere ka Kayonza ni amarembo ya Pariki y'Akagera. Iyi pariki iri mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba, ku mupaka wa Tanzaniya. Ibamo intare, ingwe, inzovu, inkura n'imbogo. Muri pariki hari amacumbi arimo Ruzizi Tented Lodge, Wilderness Magashi na Karenge Bush Camp.\nUbukungu.\nUbukungu bw'akarere bushingiye ku buhinzi, ubucuruzi n'ubukerarugendo. Muri Ukuboza 2020, abafashamyumvire 29 bahuguwe ku buhinzi bubungabunga ubutaka. Bahuguwe na Mennonite Central Committee (MCC) ku bufatanye na PAM. Bagomba gufasha abahinzi 2 000 bo mu karere.\nMu karere hari amabanki n'ibigo by'imari birimo Banki ya Kigali na Umwalimu SACCO. Amashuri arimo GS Kabare, GS Kabarondo, EP Barebereho na ES Cyinzovu."}
{"id": "8391", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8391", "title": "Pariki y'Akagera", "text": "Pariki y'Igihugu y'Akagera ni pariki y'igihugu iherereye mu burasirazuba bw'u Rwanda, ku mupaka wa Tanzaniya. Ifite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 1 122, ikaba igizwe na savane, imisozi n'ibishanga. Yitiriwe uruzi rw'Akagera rutemba ku mupaka wayo w'iburasirazuba, rukisuka mu kiyaga cya Ihema no mu biyaga bito.\nYashinzwe mu 1934, ikaba ari cyo gishanga kinini kirinzwe muri Afurika yo hagati n'ubuhungiro bwa nyuma bw'inyamaswa zo muri savane mu Rwanda. Kuva mu 2010 icungwa ku bufatanye bwa RDB n'umuryango African Parks; nyuma yo kuhagarura intare n'inkura, ubu ibamo inyamaswa eshanu zizwi nka \"Big Five\".\nImiterere.\nPariki iri mu burasirazuba bw'u Rwanda, ku mupaka wa Tanzaniya. Igizwe na savane, amashyamba, ibishanga n'ibiyaga bigera kuri cumi na bibiri, birimo ikiyaga cya Ihema. Ibiyaga n'ibishanga by'urufunzo biyihuza bigize hejuru ya kimwe cya gatatu cya pariki, bigatuma iba igishanga kinini kirinzwe muri Afurika yo hagati.\nAmateka.\nPariki y'Akagera yashinzwe mu 1934 n'ubutegetsi bw'Ababiligi bwategekaga u Rwanda icyo gihe. Yari ifite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 2 500, kandi yari izwiho urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima rukungahaye. Yari ituwe n'imbwa nyinshi zo mu gasozi (\"Lycaon pictus\"), ku buryo yigeze kwitwa \"Parc aux Lycaons\"; icyorezo cyaziciye, maze iza nyuma zibonwa mu 1984.\nNyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, impunzi zatahukaga zatuye muri pariki, maze intare zose zari ziyirimo zicwa n'abahinzi n'aborozi.\nMu 2009, RDB na African Parks basinye amasezerano y'imyaka 20 ashobora kongerwa yo gufatanya gucunga pariki, maze mu 2010 hashingwa \"Akagera Management Company\". Mu myaka itanu yakurikiyeho, hashowe miliyoni 10 z'amadolari, ku nkunga ya Howard G. Buffett Foundation, mu kongera umutekano no kugarura amoko yari yarazimiye. Hubatswe uruzitiro rwa kilometero 120 ku ruhande rw'iburengerazuba, hashyirwaho kajugujugu y'ubugenzuzi, itsinda ryihariye ririnda inkura n'itsinda ry'imbwa zirwanya ba rushimusi.\nInyamaswa.\nPariki ibamo inyamaswa zo muri savane nka twiga, inzovu, imbogo n'imparage, ndetse n'amoko y'inyoni agera kuri 500. Umubare w'inyamaswa z'inyamabere wavuye ku 4 000 mu 2010 ugera ku 13 500 mu 2018.\nInkura.\nInkura z'umukara zazanywe muri pariki zivuye muri Tanzaniya mu 1957; mu myaka ya 1970 zari zirenga 50, ariko ubuhigi butemewe buzigabanya kugeza ubwo iya nyuma iboneka mu 2007. Muri Gicurasi 2017, inkura z'umukara 18 zavuye muri Afurika y'Epfo zagaruwe muri pariki, naho muri Kamena 2019 hazanwa izindi eshanu zivuye mu busitani bw'inyamaswa butatu bwo mu Burayi, bikaba byari ubwa mbere bikozwe.\nMu Gushyingo 2021, inkura z'umweru 30 zavanywe muri Afurika y'Epfo zizanwa muri Akagera, naho muri Kamena 2025 hazanwa izindi 70, bikaba ari bwo bwimuka bunini bw'inkura bwanditswe. Akagera ni yo pariki yonyine mu Rwanda ibamo inkura.\nTwiga n'intare.\nTwiga zo mu bwoko bwa \"Masai\" zazanywe zivuye muri Kenya mu 1986; mu 2024 zari zimaze kugera kuri 78.\nAhagana mu 1990, pariki yari ifite intare ziri hagati ya 250 na 300, ariko zose zishwe nyuma ya Jenoside. Muri Nyakanga 2015, intare zirindwi zivuye muri Afurika y'Epfo zagaruwe muri pariki, ziba intare za mbere mu Rwanda nyuma y'imyaka 15.\nUbukerarugendo n'abaturage.\nKuva African Parks itangiye gucunga pariki mu 2010, umubare w'abayisura wavuye ku 8 000 ugera ku 44 000 mu 2018, bituma pariki yibeshaho ku kigero cya 80%. Mu 2025, Akagera yabaye pariki ya mbere ya African Parks yibeshaho ku mafaranga yinjiza ubwayo. Abasura pariki bashobora gutembera mu modoka bareba inyamaswa, ku manywa cyangwa nijoro, gutembera mu bwato ku kiyaga cya Ihema bareba imvubu n'ingona, no kureba inyoni.\nBuri mwaka, 10% by'amafaranga ava muri pariki agenerwa abaturage bayituriye, binyuze mu bikorwaremezo nk'amashuri n'amavuriro. Uturere twa Gatsibo, Kayonza na Nyagatare duhabwa ayo mafaranga tukayakoresha mu mishinga ifitiye abaturage akamaro, nk'amashuri y'imyuga, amavuriro, amakoperative n'ubuvumvu bwa kijyambere."}
