{"id": "8398", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8398", "title": "Akarere ka Rwamagana", "text": "Akarere ka Rwamagana ni kamwe mu turere turindwi tugize Intara y'Iburasirazuba mu Rwanda. Ni ko karimo icyicaro cy'Intara. Umujyi mukuru wako ni Rwamagana.\nAkarere ka Rwamagana gafite ubuso bwa 682 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 484 953. Kagizwe n'imirenge 14.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAmateka.\nAkarere ka Rwamagana kashyizweho n'itegeko muri Mutarama 2006.\nKagizwe n'icyari Akarere ka Muhazi n'icyari Akarere ka Bicumbi. Kagizwe kandi n'imirenge 2 yari iya Gasabo (Fumbwe na Mununu) n'imirenge 3 yari iya Kabarondo (Kaduha, Rweru na Nkungu). Hiyongereyeho icyari Umujyi wa Rwamagana.\nUbuso n'imbibi.\nAkarere ka Rwamagana gahana imbibi n'uturere dukurikira:\nAkarere kagizwe n'imirenge 14, utugari 82 n'imidugudu 474. Gafite ubuso bwa 682 km\u00b2. Muri 2022, gafite abaturage 484 953, ni ukuvuga abaturage 711 kuri km\u00b2.\nImirenge.\nAkarere ka Rwamagana kagizwe n'imirenge 14:\nUbuyobozi.\nRadjab Mbonyumuvunyi ni umuyobozi w'akarere kuva muri Gashyantare 2016. Jeanne Umutoni ni umuyobozi w'akarere wungirije ushinzwe imibereho myiza.\nUbukungu n'ibikorwa remezo.\nUbutaka bw'Akarere ka Rwamagana burera. Akarere kazwi cyane ku kwera ibitoki.\nAkarere gafite ibikorwa remezo byinshi. Harimo IPRC Gishari, ikigo nderabuzima cya Gishari n'ishuri rya Polisi y'u Rwanda (PTS Gishari). Harimo kandi amashuri, imihanda igezweho, amahoteri, amabanki, uruganda rutunganya amazi rwa Muhazi, Bella Flowers na gereza ya Nsinda.\nIsoko rya kijyambere rya Rwamagana riri mu Murenge wa Kigabiro. Mu Karere ka Rwamagana hari kandi ishami rya Banki Nkuru y'u Rwanda mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba.\nAmashuri.\nIbigo by'amashuri birimo GS Gishari, GS Ruhunda, GS Gati, GS Nsinda, GS Kavumu, Centre for Champion na EP Nyagahinga.\nImikino.\nAkarere ka Rwamagana gacumbikiye amakipe menshi y'umupira w'amaguru. Classic FC ikina mu cyiciro cya gatatu. Muhazi United FC ikina mu cyiciro cya mbere kuva muri 2022."}
{"id": "8400", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8400", "title": "Louise Mushikiwabo", "text": "Louise Mushikiwabo (wavutse ku ya 22 Gicurasi 1961) ni umunyamabanga wa kane akaba n'umunyamabanga mukuru w\u2019umuryango mpuzamahanga de la Francophonie. Yabanje kuba Minisitiri w\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga n\u2019ubutwererane mu Rwanda kuva 2009 kugeza 2018. Yabaye kandi Umuvugizi wa Guverinoma. Yabanje kuba Minisitiri w'itangazamakuru.\nKu ya 12 Ukwakira 2018, yatorewe manda y'imyaka ine ku mwanya w\u2019umunyamabanga mukuru w\u2019umuryango mpuzamahanga wabavuga ururimi rw'igifaransa (OIF) mu nama ya Francophonie yabereye i Yerevan, muri Arumeniya.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nLouise Mushikiwabo yavutse ku ya 22 Gicurasi 1961 i Kigali, umurwa mukuru w'u Rwanda. Se yari Bitsindinkumi, Bitsindinkumi yakoraga ubuhinzi, Nyina yari Nyiratulira, mubyara wa Alexis Kagame umufilozofe mu by'amateka. [6] Yabayeho mu bwana bwe i Kigali. Umuhererezi mu bana icyenda, barumuna be barimo Lando Ndasingwa, wabaye umucuruzi akaba n'umunyapolitiki uzwi cyane mu Rwanda mbere yo kwicwa mu 1994 mu gihe cya jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu mwaka wa 1994, na Anne-Marie Kantengwa, wigaruriye hoteri ya Lando (Chez Lando) nyuma y'urupfu rwe kandi akora mu Nteko ishinga amategeko y'u Rwanda kuva 2003 kugeza 2008. \nNyuma yo kurangiza amashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye i Kigali, Mushikiwabo yagiye kwiga muri kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda (ubu ni kaminuza y'u Rwanda), mu mujyi wa Huye mu majyepfo, mu 1981. Yarangije kaminuza mu 1984, afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu cyongereza, hanyuma akora muri make nk'umwarimu w'amashuri yisumbuye. Mu 1986, yavuye mu Rwanda yerekeza muri Amerika, naho yatangiye kwiga impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu ndimi no gusobanura muri kaminuza ya Delaware, naho igifaransa kikaba ururimi rwe rwihariye. Amaze kurangiza amasomo ye mu 1988, yagumye muri Amerika, atura mu gace ka Washington, DC. Yatangiye umwuga akora mu mashyirahamwe aharanira inyungu, mbere yo gufata umwanya muri Banki Nyafurika itsura amajyambere (ADB); mu rwego rwo kugira uruhare muri ADB yabaye muri Tuniziya igihe gito, amaherezo aba umuyobozi ushinzwe itumanaho muri banki. \nMu 2006, Mushikiwabo yanditse igitabo, \"\"Rwanda bivuga Universe\",\" yafatanije na Jack Kramer, umunyamakuru Amerika na KALIMANZIRA Marine. Igitabo kirimo igice cyandika ku buzima, gisobanura amateka y\u2019umuryango wa Mushikiwabo, ubuzima bwe bwa mbere mu Rwanda, ndetse n\u2019ubunararibonye bwe amaze kwimukira muri Amerika. Irasobanura kandi itsembabwoko ryo mu Rwanda mu buryo burambuye, uhereye ku mateka ndetse no ku bitekerezo bya Mushiwabo uba i Washington, kuko yakiriye amakuru avuga ko benshi mu bagize umuryango we bishwe. \nUmwuga wa politiki.\nMuri Werurwe 2008, Mushikiwabo yatumiwe na Perezida w'u Rwanda Paul Kagame gusubira mu gihugu cye cy'u Rwanda no gufata umwanya muri guverinoma ye. Yahawe umwanya wa Minisitiri w\u2019itangazamakuru, asimbuye Laurent Nkusi. Mu ntangiriro za manda ye, Mushikiwabo yari ashinzwe gufata icyemezo cyo gufata ingamba zo kurwanya amashyirahamwe menshi y\u2019itangazamakuru ryaho yari afite inkuru zisebanya kuri Kagame. Ikinyamakuru kimwe, Kinyarwanda -ururimi rwa buri munsi \"Umuco\", cyari cyasohoye inkuru igereranya perezida na Adolf Hitler, kandi Inama Nkuru y'Itangazamakuru (HCP) yasabye guverinoma guhagarika uruhushya rw\u2019iki kinyamakuru. Nkusi yari yaranze iki cyifuzo, kandi mu gihe Mushikiwabo atigeze ahagarika ku mugaragaro impapuro, nyamara yahagaritse gucapa mu Kwakira 2008. Muri rusange Mushikiwabo yashishikarije bagenzi be gushyigikira ubwisanzure bw'itangazamakuru, ariko kandi ashimangira ko itangazamakuru ryubahiriza amategeko akomeye y'u Rwanda yerekeye guhakana Jenoside mu Rwanda. Mu mwaka wa 2009, yatanze itegeko ry\u2019agateganyo kuri radiyo ya Kinyarwanda yatangajwe na British Broadcasting Corporation (BBC), kubera ko yavugaga ko ryerekanaga ibiganiro \"biha uburenganzira bwa jenoside n\u2019abahakana jenoside\"; BBC yahakanye iki kirego, ivuga ko na guverinoma bifite ibisobanuro bitandukanye kuri jenoside. \nUsibye kuba ashinzwe gufata ibyemezo bya minisiteri, Mushikiwabo yanasohoje inshingano z'umuvugizi wa guverinoma mu gihe yari Minisitiri w'itangazamakuru. Urugero, igihe u Rwanda rwagiranye ibibazo na dipolomasi n'Ubudage nyuma y\u2019ifatwa ry'umuyobozi mukuru wa protocole ya Perezida Paul Kagame, Rose Kabuye, Mushikiwabo yaganiriye n'ibitangazamakuru mpuzamahanga kugira ngo asobanure neza uko leta y'u Rwanda ihagaze. Yakoresheje ubuhanga bwe bw'indimi, abasha gutanga ibisobanuro mu ndimi zose zemewe z'u Rwanda, Kinyarwanda, Igifaransa n'Icyongereza. "}
{"id": "8401", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8401", "title": "Minisiteri y'Ibikorwa Remezo", "text": "Minisiteri y'Ibikorwa Remezo (\"Ministry of Infrastructure\", MININFRA) ni minisiteri ya Leta y'u Rwanda. Ishinzwe politiki y'ibikorwa remezo mu gihugu hose.\nIbyo bikorwa remezo ni ubwikorezi, ingufu, amazi n'isukura, n'imiturire. Kuva muri Kamena 2026, Minisitiri w'Ibikorwa Remezo ni Damien Murwanashyaka.\nInshingano.\nIcyerekezo cya MININFRA ni uguha igihugu ibikorwa remezo bigezweho. Ibyo bikorwa remezo bigomba gufasha iterambere rirambye ry'ubukungu n'imibereho myiza y'abaturage.\nInshingano z'ingenzi za MININFRA ni izi:\nIbigo bishamikiye kuri MININFRA birimo Rwanda Energy Group (REG), WASAC, RTDA, Rwanda Housing Authority na RwandAir.\nAbaminisitiri.\nMu mwaka wa 2018, Claver Gatete yasimbuye James Musoni ku buyobozi bwa MININFRA. Ku wa 31 Mutarama 2022, Ernest Nsabimana yasimbuye Gatete. Gatete yagizwe Ambasaderi w'u Rwanda mu Muryango w'Abibumbye.\nMuri Nzeri 2023, Jimmy Gasore yasimbuye Nsabimana. Ku wa 10 Kamena 2026, Damien Murwanashyaka yasimbuye Gasore. Uwo munsi, Claudien Bizimungu na Armand Zingiro bagizwe Abaminisitiri ba Leta muri iyi minisiteri."}
{"id": "8406", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8406", "title": "Akarere ka Gicumbi", "text": "Akarere ka Gicumbi ni kamwe mu turere dutanu tugize Intara y'Amajyaruguru mu Rwanda. Gaherereye mu burasirazuba bw'iyi ntara. Umujyi wako mukuru ni Byumba. Gafite ubuso bwa 828,9 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 448 824. Kagizwe n'imirenge 21.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'imbibi.\nMu majyaruguru, Akarere ka Gicumbi gahana imbibi n'Akarere ka Burera na Uganda. Mu burasirazuba hari uturere twa Nyagatare na Gatsibo. Mu majyepfo hari Akarere ka Gasabo n'agace gato ka Rwamagana, ku nkengero z'Ikiyaga cya Muhazi. Mu burengerazuba hari Akarere ka Rulindo.\nAkarere kagizwe n'imirenge 21, utugari 109 n'imidugudu 630. Gafite ubuso bwa 828,9 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 448 824. Ubucucike ni abaturage 541,5 kuri km\u00b2. Umujyi mukuru w'akarere ni Byumba.\nImirenge.\nAkarere ka Gicumbi kagizwe n'imirenge 21:"}
{"id": "8407", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8407", "title": "Akarere ka Kicukiro", "text": "Akarere ka Kicukiro ni kamwe mu turere dutatu tugize Umujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda. Gafite ubuso bwa 166,7 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 491 731. Kagizwe n'imirenge 10.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'imbibi.\nAkarere ka Kicukiro gaherereye mu burasirazuba bw'amajyepfo bw'Umujyi wa Kigali. Mu majyepfo, gahana imbibi n'Akarere ka Bugesera. Mu majyaruguru hari Akarere ka Gasabo. Mu burasirazuba hari Akarere ka Rwamagana. Mu burengerazuba hari Akarere ka Nyarugenge. Icyicaro cy'akarere kiri mu Murenge wa Kagarama, mu Kagari ka Rukatsa.\nAkarere ka Kicukiro gafite ubuso bwa 166,7 km\u00b2. Muri 2022, kari gatuwe n'abaturage 491 731.\nUbukerarugendo.\nMu Karere ka Kicukiro hari Ikibuga Mpuzamahanga cy'Indege cya Kigali, amahoteli n'ubusitani bwakira ibirori. Mu Murenge wa Gatenga hari Kigali Cultural Village, igicumbi cy'umuco. Mu Murenge wa Gahanga hari ikibuga mpuzamahanga cy'umukino wa Cricket.\nImirenge.\nAkarere ka Kicukiro kagizwe n'imirenge 10:"}
{"id": "8408", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8408", "title": "Akarere ka Nyarugenge", "text": "Akarere ka Nyarugenge ni kamwe mu turere dutatu tugize Umujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda. Gafite ubuso bwa 134 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 374 319. Kagizwe n'imirenge 10.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'abaturage.\nAkarere ka Nyarugenge gafite ubuso bwa 134 km\u00b2. Muri 2022, kari gatuwe n'abaturage 374 319. Muri bo, abagabo ni 195 780, abagore ni 178 539. Abaturage 315 899 babaga mu mujyi.\nIcyicaro cy'akarere kiri mu Murenge wa Nyarugenge, mu Kagari ka Kiyovu, mu Mudugudu wa Nyarurembo.\nImirenge.\nAkarere ka Nyarugenge kagizwe n'imirenge 10, utugari 47 n'imidugudu 350:"}
{"id": "8409", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8409", "title": "Akarere ka Musanze", "text": "Akarere ka Musanze ni kamwe mu turere dutanu tugize Intara y'Amajyaruguru mu Rwanda. Gafite ubuso bwa 530,2 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 476 522. Kagizwe n'imirenge 15.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAmateka.\nAkarere ka Musanze kashyizweho n'Itegeko No 29/2005 ryo ku wa 23 Ukuboza 2005. Gakomoka ku cyahoze ari Umujyi wa Ruhengeri, Akarere ka Mutobo n'Akarere ka Kinigi. Kagizwe kandi n'imirenge 14 y'icyahoze ari Akarere ka Bugarura n'imirenge 3 y'icyahoze ari Akarere ka Bukamba.\nUbuso n'abaturage.\nAkarere ka Musanze gafite ubuso bwa 530,2 km\u00b2. Muri ubwo buso harimo km\u00b2 60 za Pariki y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Ibirunga na km\u00b2 28 z'Ikiyaga cya Ruhondo. Akarere kagizwe n'imirenge 15, utugari 68 n'imidugudu 432.\nMuri 2022, Akarere ka Musanze kari gatuwe n'abaturage 476 522.\nImirenge.\nAkarere ka Musanze kagizwe n'imirenge 15:"}
{"id": "8411", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8411", "title": "Akarere ka Nyamagabe", "text": "Akarere ka Nyamagabe ni kamwe mu turere umunani tugize Intara y'Amajyepfo mu Rwanda. Gafite ubuso bwa 1 090 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 371 501. Kagizwe n'imirenge 17.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'abaturage.\nAkarere ka Nyamagabe kagizwe n'imirenge 17, utugari 92 n'imidugudu 536. Gafite ubuso bwa 1 090 km\u00b2. Gatuwe n'abaturage 371 501. Ibiro by'akarere biri mu Murenge wa Gasaka, mu Kagari ka Nyamugari, mu Mudugudu wa Nyarusange.\nImirenge.\nAkarere ka Nyamagabe kagizwe n'imirenge 17:"}
{"id": "8412", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8412", "title": "Akarere ka Nyaruguru", "text": "Akarere ka Nyaruguru ni kamwe mu turere umunani tugize Intara y'Amajyepfo mu Rwanda. Gahana imbibi n'Uburundi. Gafite ubuso bwa 1 010 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 318 126. Kagizwe n'imirenge 14.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'imbibi.\nAkarere ka Nyaruguru gahana imbibi n'uturere twa Nyamagabe, Huye na Gisagara. Gahana kandi imbibi n'Uburundi na Pariki ya Nyungwe.\nAkarere kagizwe n'imirenge 14, utugari 72 n'imidugudu 332. Gafite ubuso bwa 1 010 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 318 126.\nUbukungu n'ubukerarugendo.\nAkarere ka Nyaruguru kazwi ku bukerarugendo bushingiye ku iyobokamana. Ubuhinzi bw'icyayi ni bwo shingiro ry'ubukungu bw'akarere. I Kibeho ni ho habaye amabonekerwa ya Bikira Mariya.\nImirenge.\nAkarere ka Nyaruguru kagizwe n'imirenge 14:"}
{"id": "8413", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8413", "title": "Akarere ka Ngororero", "text": "Akarere ka Ngororero ni kamwe mu turere turindwi tugize Intara y'Uburengerazuba mu Rwanda. Kagizwe n'imisozi miremire n'ibibaya. Gafite ubuso bwa 679 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 367 955. Kagizwe n'imirenge 13.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'imbibi.\nMu burengerazuba, Akarere ka Ngororero gahana imbibi n'Akarere ka Rutsiro. Mu majyaruguru hari Akarere ka Nyabihu. Mu majyaruguru ashyira iburasirazuba hari Akarere ka Gakenke. Mu majyepfo hari Akarere ka Karongi. Mu burasirazuba hari Akarere ka Muhanga. Ibiro by'akarere biri ku muhanda Muhanga\u2013Ngororero\u2013Mukamira. Biri ku birometero 46,6 uvuye i Muhanga.\nAkarere kagizwe n'imirenge 13, utugari 73 n'imidugudu 416. Gafite ubuso bwa 679 km\u00b2. Muri 2022, gafite abaturage 367 955, ni ukuvuga abaturage 551 kuri km\u00b2.\nImiterere.\nUbutumburuke bw'akarere buri hagati ya metero 1 460 na metero 2 883. Umusozi muremure ni Bweru, mu Murenge wa Muhanda. Ufite ubutumburuke bwa metero 2 883. Izindi mpinga ndende ziri mu ishyamba rya Gishwati. Ubushyuhe buringaniye ni 18 \u00b0C.\nAkarere gafite amazi menshi. Kari mu kibaya cy'uruzi rwa Nili. Umugezi w'ingenzi ni Nyabarongo. Indi migezi ni Rubagabaga, Mukungwa, Satinsyi, Muhembe na Kibirira.\nUbukerarugendo.\nAhantu nyaburanga ho mu Karere ka Ngororero harimo Umukore wa Rwabugiri, Pariki ya Gishwati-Mukura n'inzuri za Gishwati."}
{"id": "8416", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8416", "title": "Urutonde rw'Abami bayoboye u Rwanda", "text": "Uru rupapuro rugizwe n'urutonde rw'abami (\"mwami\", plural \"abami\") bu Rwanda. The Kingdom of Rwanda was one of the oldest and the most centralized kingdoms in the history of Central and East Africa.\nIts state and affairs before King Gihanga is largely unconfirmed and highly shrouded in mythical tales.\nThis article contains a list of kings of Rwanda. The Kingdom of Rwanda was ruled by sovereigns titled \"mwami\" (plural \"abami\"), and was one of the oldest and the most centralized kingdoms in the history of Central and East Africa.\nIts state and affairs before King Gihanga I is largely unconfirmed and highly shrouded in mythical tales.\nDue to a lack of clarification surrounding the oral traditions, many different dates are suggested for the reigns of the kings. This article, from Ruganzu II Ndoli onwards, uses the chronology of Jan Vansina, who has written much on the histories of the Democratic Republic of the Congo, Rwanda and Burundi.\nPretenders since 1961.\nOn 28 January 1961, during the Rwandan Revolution, the country abolished its monarchy and became a republic (retroactively approved by a referendum held on 25 September of the same year). Afterwards, Kigeli V Ndahindurwa continued to maintain his claim to the throne until his death on 16 October 2016 in Washington, D.C. On 9 January 2017, the Royal Council of Abiru announced Prince Emmanuel Bushayija as the new heir to the throne. Prince Emmanuel adopted the regnal name Yuhi VI."}
{"id": "8417", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8417", "title": "Akarere ka Nyabihu", "text": "Akarere ka Nyabihu ni kamwe mu turere turindwi tugize Intara y'Uburengerazuba mu Rwanda. Ibiro byako biri mu Murenge wa Mukamira. Gafite ubuso bwa 531,5 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 319 047. Kagizwe n'imirenge 12.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'imbibi.\nAkarere ka Nyabihu gahana imbibi n'uturere twa Rubavu, Musanze, Ngororero na Rutsiro. Gahana kandi imbibi na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nIbiro by'akarere biri mu Murenge wa Mukamira, mu Kagari ka Rubaya, mu Mudugudu wa Cyivugiza. Akarere kagizwe n'imirenge 12, utugari 73 n'imidugudu 473. Gafite ubuso bwa 531,5 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 319 047.\nAkarere kazwi cyane kubera ahantu nyaburanga, imisozi n'ibiyaga. Kazwi kandi kubera amashuri menshi n'ibiranga amateka."}
{"id": "8418", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8418", "title": "Akarere ka Rusizi", "text": "Akarere ka Rusizi ni kamwe mu turere turindwi tugize Intara y'Uburengerazuba mu Rwanda. Kari ku Ikiyaga cya Kivu. Gahana imbibi n'Uburundi na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Gafite ubuso bwa 940,95 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 485 529. Kagizwe n'imirenge 18.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'imbibi.\nMu majyepfo, Akarere ka Rusizi gahana imbibi n'Uburundi. Umugezi wa Ruhwa ni wo mupaka. Mu burengerazuba hari Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Ikiyaga cya Kivu n'Umugezi wa Rusizi ni byo bitandukanya ibihugu byombi.\nAkarere kagizwe n'imirenge 18, utugari 93 n'imidugudu 596. Gafite ubuso bwa 940,95 km\u00b2. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, kari gatuwe n'abaturage 485 529. Umujyi wa Rusizi ni umwe mu mijyi itandatu yunganira Umujyi wa Kigali.\nImirenge.\nAkarere ka Rusizi kagizwe n'imirenge 18:\nUbukungu.\nAkarere ka Rusizi gahinga umuceli mu kibaya cya Bugarama. Gahinga kandi icyayi, ikawa, imbuto, urutoki, ibigori, ibishyimbo n'imyumbati. Aborozi borora inka, ihene n'ingurube. Mu Kiyaga cya Kivu harobwa amafi n'isambaza.\nUbukerarugendo.\nAhantu nyaburanga ho mu Karere ka Rusizi harimo Ikiyaga cya Kivu, amashyuza ya Bugarama n'ishyamba rya Cyamudongo. Harimo kandi Pariki ya Nyungwe, Umugezi wa Rusizi n'Ikibuga cy'indege cya Kamembe."}
