{"id": "8576", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8576", "title": "Jimmie Johnson", "text": "Jimmie Kenneth Johnson (wavukiye El Cajon, muri Californiya, ku ya 17 Nzeri 1975) ni umunyamerika wabigize umwuga.\nJohnson yakinnye mu gikombe cya NASCAR kuva muri 2002 kugeza 2020 hamwe n'ikipe ya Hendrick Motorsports. Muri uru ruhererekane yatsindiye ibikombe birindwi: 2006, 2007, 2008, 2009, 2010, 2013 na 2016 kandi angana na Richard Petty na Dale Earnhardt.\nKuva mu 2021 Johnson yimukiye muri IndyCar kugirango yinjire mu ikipe ya Chip Ganassi Racing."}
